<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">1 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim an timi tlangpar ramah Ramah timi khua a um ih cutawk khua ah Efraim miphun sung ihsin Elkanah an timi mipa pakhat a rak um. Amah cu Zuf miphun Tohu ih cithlah a si mi Elihu ih fa Jeroham ih fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elkanah cu nupi pahnih a nei ih Hannah le Peninnah an si. Peninnah cun fa a nei, asinain Hannah cun fa pakhat hman a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Elkanah cu a khua ihsin Shiloh khua ah kumtinte Ziangkimtithei Bawipa bia dingah le thawinak pe dingah a feh ṭheu. Shiloh khua ah Bawipa ih puithiam cu Eli ih fapa pahnih Hofni le Finehas an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Elkanah in Bawipa hnenih thawinak a pek tikah a nupi Peninnah le a faale pawl hnenah an covo ciar a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a nupi Hannah cu a duhdawtzet ko naón a covo pakhat lawng a pek, ziangahtile Bawipa in faate a pek lo ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih fa neilo a si ruangah a huatu Peninnah cun Hannah cu a tisiat ih a ning a zakter ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuticun kum khat hnu kum khat a si vivo. Bawipa ih inn ih an feh tikah Peninnah in Hannah cu a riah a siatter ṭheu ih Hannah cu rawl hman ei loin a ṭap ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah a pasal Elkanah cun, “Hannah, ziangah so na ṭah ih rawl tla na ei lo? Ziangah so riahsia ih na um ringring? Na hrangah keimah hi fapa pahra hnakin ka sunglawi sawn lo maw?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Voikhat cu Shiloh khua ah rawl an ei ṭheh tikah Hannah cu a tho ih a thinlung a hartuk ruangah Bawipa ih hnenah ṭap phah in thla a cam. Puithiam hna a ṭuantu Eli cu Bawipa ih biakinn ih sangka kiangah a tokham parah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Hannah cu thla a cam ih, “Maw Bawipa , Cungnungbik Pathian, kei na salnu hi i run hmu hram aw. Ka zonzaihnak hi i theihsak in kei hi i ciing hram aw. I hngilh hram hlah aw. Fapate i zaangfah a si ahcun a nunsung hmuahhmuah na hrangah ka lo pe ding ih a sam khal meh a si dah lo ding, tiah ka lo kam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hannah cu Bawipa hnenah reizet thla a cam ih Hannah ih hmur cu Eli in a zoh ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Daite ih thla a cam hrangah a hmur cu a caang rero naón a aw a suak lo. Cutiih a um cu zu a ri a si tiah Eli in a ruah hrangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hannah hnenah, “Zu ri tahratin mualpho in um nawn hlah. Feh awla va fimharh ta aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Hannah in, “Asilo, bawipa, zu ka ri lo. Zu hrimhrim ka in lo, sabitti khal ka in lo. Ka thin a hartuk ruangah Bawipa ih hnenah ka vansannak ka thlet thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nunau hlolak a si tiah i ruat hram hlah aw. Ka thin a pit ih ka van a san tuk ruangah hiti ih thla ka cam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Eli in, “Hnangamtein va feh awla Israel ih Pathian in a hnenih na dilmi cu lo pe hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Hannah in, “Ka parah zaangfahnak thinlung nei ringring aw,” tiah a ti ih a feh. Cuih hnuah rawl malte a ei ih a riah khal a sia nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thaizing ah Elkanah le a innsang pawl cu an tho ih Bawipa Pathian cu an biak. Cuih hnuah Ramah khua an inn ah an kir. Cule Elkanah le a nupi Hannah cu an pawl-aw ih Hannah ih thlacamnak cu Bawipa in a theihsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutiin Hannah cu fa a vun ih fapa a hring. A fapa cu Samuel tiah hmin a sak, ziangahtile “ Bawipa hnenih ka dilmi a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Elkanah le a innsang pawl cu kumtinte an pek ṭheumi thawinak le a thukam cia bangtuk in a hleice ih thawinak Bawipa hnenih pek dingah Shiloh khua ah an feh lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain Hannah cu a feh lo. A pasal hnenah, “Ka fapa cu hnawi a thlah vete in Bawipa inn ah ka fehpi pei ih cutawkah a nunsung hmuahhmuah a um ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Elkanah in, “A ṭha bik na timi cu tuah awla naute hnawi a thlah hlan cu inn ah um ko aw. Cun Bawipa in na thukammi cu kimter hram seh,” tiah a ti. Cutiin Hannah cu inn ah a um ih a fapa cu ṭhatein a zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hnawi a thlah tikah a nu in Samuel cu Shiloh ah a fehpi ih kum thum a timi cawcang pakhat, sangphut han khat le sabit thawl khat tla an keng. Nauhakte asinain Samuel cu a nu in Shiloh khua Bawipa ih inn ahcun a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cawcang cu an that ih Samuel cu Eli hnenah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Hannah in, “Bawipa, i hngilh zo maw si? Hitawk ah dingin Bawipa hnenah thla a cammi nunau kha keimah ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bawipa hnenah fapa te ka dil ih atu-ah ka dilmi cu i pek zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah amah cu Bawipa hnenah ka pek. A nunsung hmuahhmuah amah cu Bawipa ih ta a si ding,” tiah a ti. Cule Bawipa cu cutawkah an biak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hannah cu hiti in thla a cam: “ Bawipa in ka thinlung cu lungawinak in a khahter zo; A tuahcia mi ruangah ka lung a awi. Ka ral pawl ka hnihsan thei zo; I bom zo ruangah ka lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa bangtuk a thianghlim mi zohman an um lo; Kan Pathian vekih Lungpi dang zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thangzetih nan tluangkhawnnak bang thlang uh; A puarthau zetmi nan ṭongkam cu daiter uh. Ziangahtile Bawipa cu ziangtinkim a theitu Pathian a si; Minung pawl ih tuahmi hmuahhmuah parah thureltu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A cakmi ralkap pawl ih li le thal a kiak ṭheh; Asinain mi ṭawnṭai pawl cu an cak sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rawl a khopzetmi pawl rawl hawl ah hlawhfa an tla ih, Rilrawng pawl an pum a puar sal. Fa nei thei lo nunau in fa pasarih a nei ih, Fa tampi a neimi nu fa nei lo ah a cang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in a thihter ih nunnak a pe sal; Mithi khua ah a thlenter hai ih, A thi mi pawl tla a nunter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat a farah terih a hrek cu a lianter; A hrekkhat mi nauta a canter ih, A dang cu mi pipa ah a canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi nauta pawl leivut lak ihsin a khaisaang ih, Mi tlasam pawl vutcam lak ihsin a cawisaang a si. Siangpahrang ih fapa pawl thawn a toter ih, upatnak hmun ah a toh hai. Leilung hramṭohnak pawl cu Bawipa ih ta an si; Cuih parah leilung hi a dinter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A mithianghlim pawl ih ke feh a kilkhawi; Asinain mi siava pawl cu khawthim lakah an hlo ralta; Milai cahnak lawngin hlawhtlinnak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa a dodaltu pawl cu siatsuah thluh an si ding; Vancung ihsin khawri bangin a run tlir hai ding. Bawipa in leilung pumpi thu a rel ding; A siangpahrang hnenah cahnak a pe ding; A hrilciami siangpahrang cu nehtu a siter ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Elkanah cu Ramah ah a kir. Asinain Samuel cu Shiloh ah a umta ih puithiam Eli ih kuthnuai ah Bawipa ih hna a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eli ih fapa pawl cu misualral an si. Bawipa Pathian khal zianghman ah an siar lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi pawl hnen ihsin puithiam pawl ih covo an ngahdan pawl tla an tisual thluh. An daan bangtuk in mi pakhat in Pathian hnenih thawinak a pek tikah puithiam ih hnen-um pa cu ṭeek thum a ṭeekmi darhai thawn a ra. Thawinak sa an suan rero laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />beel sungih sa cu a darhai cun a vun sawh ih a thur theimi poh cu puithiam hrangah a si. Thawinak pe dingah Shiloh khua ih a rami Israel mi pawl hmuahhmuah hrangah cubangtuk in an tuah ringring a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Eli ih fapa pawl ih san ahcun an thahmi sa ih a thau hman mei ih an ur hlanah puithiam ih hnen-um pa a ra ih thawinak a tuahtu pa hnenah, “Puithiam hrangih em dingah sa i pe aw. Suan ciami cu a saang lo ding. Sahring lawnglawng a saang a si,” tiah a ra ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah thawinak a petu pa in, “A thau hi mei in kan ur hmaisa pei ih cuih hnuah na duhmi na lak leh pei,” tiah a ti tikah, puithiam ih hnen-um pa cun, “Asilo, atu-ah i pe aw. I pek lo asile hranhram in ka lak ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuticun Eli ih fapa pawl ih sualnak cu Bawipa ih hmaiah a tum ngaingai, ziangahtile Bawipa hnenih pek mi thawinak pawl kha nautatnak thawn an borhhlawhter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nauhakpa te Samuel cu Bawipa ih puithiam hna a ṭuan ih puan nemte ih tuahmi ṭaangthlaih angki a hruk ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumtinte a nu in korfual a ṭhit sak ih, kum khatah voikhat thawinak a pasal thawn an pek tikah a cuih korfual cu a fapa a pek ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Elkanah le a nupi cu Eli in thluasuahnak a pek hai ih Elkanah hnenah, “ Bawipa hnenih na pekmi fapa aiah hi na nupi sung ihsin Bawipa in faate dang lo pe hram seh,” tiah a ti. Cuih hnuah an khua ah an tlung ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa in Hannah cu a thluasuah ngaingai ih faate dang fapa pathum le fanu pahnih tla a nei sal. Nauhak pa Samuel cu Bawipa ih hna ṭuan in a ṭhang vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eli cu a tarzet thlang. Israel mi pawl parih a fapa pawl an nuncan le Pathian umnak Puanthlam sung luhnak sangka-ih hnaṭuantu nunau pawl hman an sualpinak thu a thei ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah a fapa pawl hnenah, “Ziangah hi vekin nan nung? Mi hmuahhmuah in thil sualral nan tuahnak thu hi in sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Faale uh, cuvek cu tuah nawn hlah uh. Bawipaói minung pawl ih an rel rero mi hi thu ṭha lozet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi pakhat in midang parih a sual ahcun thuremtu ah Pathian a um. Sikhalsehla mi pakhat in Pathian parih a sual ahcun zo in so remnakthu a tuah thei ding?” tiah a ti. An pa in a kawk rero naón an lung duh lo, ziangahtile anmah tla cu that dingah Bawipa in a ruat cia zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nauhak pa Samuel cu Pathian hmai le minung hmaiah mithmai ṭha co in a ṭhang vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Profet pakhat Eli hnenah a ra ih Bawipa ih thu cu hiti in a ra sim, “Nan pu Aaron le a sungkhat pawl Izipt ram sungih Faro ih sal an si laiah Aaron hnenah ka rak lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka puithiam an sinak dingah le biakṭheng ah ka hna ṭuan in rimthaw zihmui tla an ur ih ka hrangah korfual thianghlim a phurtu an sinak dingah amah ih sungkhat pawl cu Israel miphun hmuahhmuah sungih sin ka hril zo a si. Cuih tlunah biakṭheng parih meisa ur in thawinak an pekmi sung ihsin an ngah venak dingah covo ka pek hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutiin a si ko naón ziangah so keimah ih thupekmi vekih an thawimi le saserh an pekmi duhhamnak thawn na zoh ih na nahsuah? Ziangah so ka miphun Israel mi pawl ih thawinak an pekmi hmuahhmuah lakih sathaw bik cu na fapa pawl eiter tahrat in nanmah hmuah nan thau thluh? Keimah hnakin na fapa pawl na sunloih sawn maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na sungkhat siseh, na phunpi siseh kumkhua in keimah ih puithiam nan ṭuan pei tiah Israel ih Bawipa Pathian, Keimah hrimhrim in ka lo tiam cia zo. Sikhalsehla cubangtuk in a si nawn lo pei, tiah atu-ah ka lo sim. I sunloihtu sawn kha ka sunloih ve pei ih i hmuhsuamtu cu ka hmuhsuam ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ruathnik, na sungkhat sungah tarkunih a nungmi an um lonak dingah na sungkhat le na phunpi sungih tlangval hmuahhmuah ka thihter thluhnak tikcu a ra thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah na ning a hang ding ih Israel mi pawl hnenih thluasuah ka pekmi na nahsik zet ding, asinain na sungkhat lakah tarkun tiang a nungdammi pakhat hman an um dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na tesinfa sung ihsin mi pakhat lawnglawng a nungdam ding ih ka puithiam hna a ṭuan ding. Amah cu a mit a caw ding ih thinpit beidong in a um ding. Na tesinfa dang hmuahhmuah cu saarthih in an thi thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cun na fapa pahnih Hofni le Finehas tla cu ni khat ni rori ih an thih tikah ka thusimmi pawl hi a dik a si, ti a lang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuih hnuah ka hrangih rintlak a si mi puithiam pakhat ka hril ding ih tuah ka duhmi hmuahhmuah a tuah thluh ding. Tesinfa tampi ka pe ding ih anmah tla cu ka hril mi siangpahrang ih hmaiah hna an ṭuan ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na tesinfa lakah nungdammi an um asile rawl ei ding an ngahnak dingah siangpahrang hnenah feh in paisa le rawl an dil ding ih puithiam pawl bawmtu an si theinak ding tla an dil ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nauhakpa Samuel cu Eli ih kuthnuai ah Bawipa ih hnaṭuanin a um. Cuih tikcu ah Bawipa ih ṭongkam a mal vivo ih Bawipa ih langnak khal a um tuk nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eli cu a mit a mal thlang. Zankhat cu a ihnak khaan ah a it ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel cu Bawipa ih thukam kuang retnak khaan ah a it ve. Khua a vang hrih lo, Bawipa ih mei-inn a vanglai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Samuel cu Bawipa in a run ko. Samuel in, “ Bawipa , ka um ko,” tiah a ti ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eli hnenah a va tlan ih, “Ka ra zo, ziangah so i kawh?” tiah a ti. Eli in, “Ka lo ko lo, feh awla va it sal aw,” tiah a ti. Curuangah Samuel cu a va it sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Samuel” tiah a ko sal. Samuel cu a tho ih Eli hnenah a feh ih, “Ka ra zo, ziangah so i kawh?” tiah a ti. Eli cun, “Ka fapa, ka lo ko lo; feh awla va it sal aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Samuel cun Bawipa in i ko, ti a thei lo; ziangahtile Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu Samuel hnenah phuan in a um dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Voithum tiang Bawipa in Samuel cu a ko. Samuel cu a tho ih Eli hnenah a feh lala ih, “Ka ra zo, ziangah so i kawh?” tiah a ti. Cutikah Samuel kotu cu Bawipa a si, tiah Eli in a thei ih a hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Va feh awla va it sal aw; a lo ko sal asile ‘ Bawipa na sim duhmi sim aw; na aw ka thei a si,’ tiah na ti pei,” a ti. Cutiin Samuel cu a va it sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cu a ra ih a kiangah a ding, “Samuel, Samuel,” tiah a hlan bangtuk thotho in a ko. Cutikah Samuel in, “ Bawipa , na sim duhmi cu sim aw. Na salpa in na aw ka thei a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in, “Israel mi pawl ih parah ṭihnungza thil pakhat ka tuah ding ih cuih ka tuahmi a theitu hmuahhmuah in an tuk a sum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A cuih ni ahcun Eli ih sungkhat pawl hrangah thusia ka simmi hmuahhmuah ṭongkam pakhat hman hrelh loin ka kimter thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A fapa pawl in ka thang in siatter ruangah a sungkhat pawl cu ka hrem hai ding a si, tiah Eli ka sim cia zo. A fapa pawl ih thil ṭha lo an tuahmi a thei naón a kham lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah ziangvek thawinak le thil an pek khalle hitluk sualnak tum an tuahmi cu a tlengfai thei nawn lo pei, tiah Eli sungkhat pawl hnenah fiangtein ka run phuang a si,” tiah Samuel hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel cu khawvang tiang a it. Cuih hnuah a tho ih biakinn sangka pawl a ong. A hmuhmi le a theihmi pawl cu Eli hnenah a sim ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Eli in, “Ka fapa, Samuel,” tiah a ko. Samuel in, “Hinah ka um!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Eli in, “ Bawipa in ziangso a lo sim? Zianghman pheh hlah aw. Ka hnenih na sim ṭheh lo asile Pathian in nasazet in a lo hrem ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah Samuel in a sim ṭheh. A phehmi pakhat hman a um lo. Cule Eli in, “Amah cu Bawipa a si ih a mithmuh ah a ṭha bik a timi tuah ko seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel cu a ṭhang vivo. Bawipa a hnenah a um ih a simmi hmuahhmuah Bawipa in a kimter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi hmuahhmuah in, an ram zim le dengih a ummi pawl tiangin, Samuel cu Bawipa ih profet a si tiah an thei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Samuel hnenih a langnak le a ṭongnak hmun Shiloh ahcun Bawipa cu cat loin a lang ringring a si. Cule Samuel a ṭong tikah Israel mi pawl in an ngai duhzet.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A cuih caanah Filistin mi pawl do dingah Israel mi pawl cu an pok. Israel ralkap pawl cu Ebenezer ah an riak ih Filistin ralkap pawl cu Afek ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An tim-awk thluh hnuah Filistin pawl in Israel pawl cu an do ih nasazet ih an do awk hnuah Israel mi cu an neh ih minung thawng li tluk an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A luatmi ralkap pawl cu an riahnak hmun an thlen tikah Israel mi hruaitu pawl in, “Ziangah so Filistin pawl ih in neh dingah Pathian in a tuah? Pathian kan hnenih a feh venak dingah le kan ral pawl ih kutsung ihsin kan luatnak dingah kan feh pei ih Shiloh ihsin Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu kan lak pei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Shiloh ah mi an thlah ih cherub timi thlanei ramsa lem pahnih karlakah tokham parih a totu Ziangkimtithei Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu an va lak. Cunah cun Eli ih fapa pahnih Hofni le Finehas khal an tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thukam Kuang an thlenpi tikah Israel mi pawl cu an au ciamco ih an au tuk ruangah leilung tiangin a hnin ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih an au cu Filistin mi pawl in an theih tikah, “Hebru mi pawl an riahnak ih an au ciamco cu ngaihnik uh! Ziang so an duhnak a si?” tiah an ti-aw. Cule Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang Hebru mi pawl ih riahnak ah a thleng zo a si ti an theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />an thin a phang ih, “An riahnak ah khawzing pakhat a ra thleng zo. Curuangah kannih cu kan cem a si. Hi bangtuk thil cu kan thei dah keel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi bangtuk ih huham a nei mi khawzing pawl ih kutsung ihsin zoso in runsuak thei ding? Nelrawn ih Izipt mi pawl a that thluhtu cu hi khawzing pawl hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Filistin mi pawl, nan ral ṭha uh! Pacang bangin do uh. Culole kan sal an si vekin anmah Hebru pawl ih sal ah kan cang tengteng ding. Curuangah pacang vekin do uh!” tiah Filistin mi pawl an au ciamco ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Filistin mi pawl cun ralṭha zetin an do. Israel mi pawl cu an sung ih an inn lamah an tlan thluh. Mi tampi an thi: Israel ralkap thawng sawmthum an thi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang khal Filistin mi pawl in an lon ih Eli ih fapa Hofni le Finehas khal an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ral an do awknak hmun ihsin Benjamin hrin mi pakhat cu Shiloh lamah a tlan ih cuih ni ah a va thleng. A riahsiatnak langnak ah a hnipuan a thlek ih a lu ah leivut a phulh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eli cu lamzin kiangah tokham parah khawruahhar zetin a to. Pathian Thukam Kuang thu a ruah tikah a helhkam ngaingai. Culai ah raltlan pa cun khawsungah thu a rung than ih khawsung mi pawl cu lung phang in an ṭap ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih thawmvang cu Eli in a theih tikah, “Ziang thawmvang so a si?” tiah a sut. Ral tlan pa cu zamrang in Eli hnenah thuthang sim dingin a va tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eli cu kum sawmkua le kum riat a si zo ih khua a hmu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah ral tlan pa cun, “Raldonak hmun ihsin ka luat ih tuihsun ah hitawk tiang ka ra tlan a si,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Eli in, “Ziang a cang, ka fapa?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Filistin mi pawl in in neh ih Israel mi pawl cu an tlan ṭheh. Kan sung thla rori a si. Cuih tlunah na fapa pahnih Hofni le Finehas khal an thi; Pathian Thukam Kuang khal in long a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiih Thukam Kuang thu a vun sim vete in Eli cu kotka kiangih a tokham ihsin dunglam ah a ril. A tar tuk zo ih tlunah a khiing khal a rit tuk ruangah a rilhnak ah a hngawng a kiak ih a thi. Eli cu Israel mi pawl hotu kum sawmli sung a ṭuan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eli ih fapa Finehas ih nupi cu fa a vun ih, a nithla a kim zik thlang. Cule Pathian Thukam Kuang cu Filistin mi pawl in an long ih a pasal ih pa Eli le a pasal Finehas tla an thi ti a theih tikah ruah lopi in a pum a na ih fa a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah cu nauhrin natnak ihsin a thihzik zawng ah a tuamhlawmtu nunau nu in, “Na thinphang hlah aw; fapa na hring a si,” tiah a ti. Asinain Finehas ih nupi cun zianghman a sawn lo; zianghman ti theimi a nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fapa cu Ikhabod tiah hmin a sak, a tican cu, “Pathian ih sunlawinak in Israel a tlansan a si,” tinak a si. A sim duhmi cu Pathian ih Thukam Kuang an lonnak le a rang Eli le a pasal Finehas an thihnak thu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Pathian ih Thukam Kuang an lon ruangah Pathian ih sunlawinak in Israel cu a tlansan zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian Thukam Kuang cu Filistin mi pawl ih an lon ngah hnuah Ebenezer ihsin Ashdod khua ah an phur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dagon an timi an khuazing biaknak inn ah an fehpi ih Dagon kiangah an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaizing ah Pathian ih Thukam Kuang hmaiah Dagon ih lempi cu a bokkhup in a tluk kha Ashdod khuami pawl in an hmu. An tung saal ih a um keel in an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang hmaiah Dagon ih zukpi cu a bokkhup in a tluk sal lala kha an hmu. A lu le a ban pawl a tan-aw thluh ih sangka kiangah an ril teptep. A ruangpi lawnglawng a taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah tuihsan tiangin Ashdod khua ih puithiam pawl le Dagon a biatu pawl cun Dagon a tluknak hmun cu pal loin an lan ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod khuami pawl cu Bawipa in nasazet in a hrem ih an thin a phang ringring. Ashdod khuami lawng si loin a kiangkap khuami pawl khal a hrem ih khuaihli hma in an hma thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutiih a si cu misenpi in an hmuh tikah, “Israel mi pawl ih Pathian in kanmah le kan khawzing Dagon tiangin in hrem a si. Thukam Kuang cu hitawk ih umter hrih dingah a cang nawn lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah mi an thlah ih Filistin mi pawl hotu lal panga an ko khawm ih, “Israel mi pawl Pathian ih Thukam Kuang hi ziangtinso kan tuah ding?” tiah an sut. Cutikah annih in, “Gath ah va ret uh,” an ti. An ti bangtuk in Gath ahcun an va ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain Gath ih an ret vete in Bawipa in Gath khawsungmi pawl a hrem ih an van a sang ngaingai. Gath khawsungmi hmuahhmuah a tum a sen in khuaihli hma an tuar ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Thukam Kuang cu Ekron khua ah an kuat. Ekron khua an thlenpi vete in khuasungmi pawl cu, “Israel mi Pathian ih Thukam Kuang an rak thlenpi ih in that thluh ding,” tiah an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah Filistin mi pawl ih lal pawl cu an ko khawm lala ih, “Israel mi pawl ih Thukam Kuang cu a rak umnak ah kuat sal uh; cuticun kanmah le kan sungkhat pawl kan thi lo ding,” tiah an ti. Nasazet in Pathian in a hrem hai ruangah khawsungmi pawl cu an awlok a song ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thi lomi pawl khal cu khuaihli hma in an na ih mi hmuahhmuah in an khawzing pawl hnenah bomnak dil in an au ciamco.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu Filistin ramah thla sarih a um hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin mi hotu pawl in an puithiam le pol pawl an ko ih, “ Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang hi ziangtin so kan tuah ding? A umnak hmunih kan kuat sal asile ziangthawn so kan kuat ding?” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Israel mi Pathian ih Thukam Kuang cu nan kuat sal asile nan mawhnak ngaidamnak dingah Pathian hnenah laksawng nan pek pei ih cumi thawn nan kuat pei. Laksawng tel loin Thukam Kuang cu nan kuat lo pei. Laksawng thawn nan kuat kir sal asile nan dam dingih Pathian in ziangah so in rak hrem ti cu nan thei ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ziang laksawng so kan pek ding?” tiah an sut. Cutikah annih in, “Sui ih tuahmi khuaihli hma zuk panga le zinghnam zuk panga, Filistin lal pakhat hrangah zuk pakhat ciar in nan pek pei. Ziangahtile hremnak cu nan zate le Filistin lal panga in nan tuar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan khua le nan ram a siatsuahtu khuaihli hma zuk le zinghnam zuk pawl cu nan tuah pei ih Israel mi pawl ih Pathian hnenah nan sualnak nan phuang pei. Cutiih nan tuah asile nanmah, nan khawzing le nan ramih hremnak nan tuarnak ihsin a lo luatter men ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ziangah so Faro le Izipt mi bangin mi lungruh nan si duh rero? Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl an suahter hlan lo Izipt mi pawl tla cu Pathian in a duhduh in a puahcok rero hai ti nan hngilh lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah cawleng a thar pakhat le leng a hnuk dah lomi cawpi pahnih in ngaihtuah uh. Cuih caw cu lengah barh uhla an faate pawl kha caw inn ah khum uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang kha lak uhla cawleng parah ret uh. Cule nan mawhnak ngaidamnak dingah Pathian hnenih nan pekmi sui zuk pawl cu thingkuang dangin a cuih Thukam Kuang kiangah ret uh. Cun cawleng cu amahte in mawngtu loin fehseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule a feh cu zoh uh. Beth Shemesh khua lamih a feh a si ahcun kan parih siatsuahnak a thlentertu cu Israel mi pawl ih Pathian a si, ti a lang ding. Asinain Beth Shemesh khua lamih a feh lo a si ahcun natnak petu cu Israel mi pawl ih Pathian a si lo; kan vansiat ruangah a si men, ti kan thei ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiam le pol pawl ih sim vekin an tuah thluh. Cawpi pahnih cu an hruai ih cawleng ah an barh ih caw faate pawl cu caw inn ah an khum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian Thukam Kuang cu an lak ih, sui ih tuahmi khuaihli hma zuk le zinghnam zuk pawl an retnak thingkuang thawn cawleng sungah cun an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah caw pawl cu an feh ih khuilam hmanah pial lotein Beth Shemesh khua lamah dingtein an feh vivo. An feh phah ah an paw rero. Filistin mi ih lal panga in Beth Shemesh khua ramri tiang an hei thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beth Shemesh khuami pawl cu phairawn ah sangvut an at lai rero. Khua an hun cuan ih Thukam Kuang an hmuh tikah an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth Shemesh khuami Joshua ih lo sungah cawleng cu a ra thleng ih lungto tumpi kiangah a cawl. Cuih khuami pawl cun zanthing ih tuahmi leng cu an satbal ih caw pahnih cu an that ih Bawipa ih hnenah meisa ur in thawinak ah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi mi pawl in Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang le sui ih tuah mi zuk pawl retnak kuang cu an cawi ih lungto tumpi parah cun an ret. A cuih ni ah Beth Shemesh khuami pawl in mei-ur thawinak le thawinak dangdang tla Bawipa ih hnenah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Filistin mi lal panga cun Beth Shemesh khuami pawl ih thiltuah mi cu an zoh ṭheh hnu a cuih ni thotho ah Ekron ah an kirsal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl in an khawpi panga - Ashdod, Gaza, Ashkelon, Gath le Ekron hrangah, khua khatah pakhat ciar in, sui in tuahmi khuaihli hma zuk panga cu Bawipa hnenah an mawhnak ngaidamnak dingah an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Filistin mi lal panga ih ukmi kulhmi khawpi siseh, kulh lomi khawte siseh, lal pakhat ukmi khua pawl cu sui ih tuahmi zinghnam zuk pakhat ciar an pek fawn. Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang an retnak, Beth Shemesh khuami Joshua lo sungih a ummi lungto tumpi cu cutawkih a cangmi thutheihpitu ah atu tiangin a um lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Beth Shemesh khuami pawl in Thukam Kuang sung an bih ruangah Bawipa in mi hrekkhat cu a that. Minung sawm sarih an thi a si. Cutiih mi tampi Bawipa in a thihter ruangah cuih khuami pawl cu an riah a sia ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Beth Shemesh khuami pawl in, “Hi Bawipa , a thianghlim mi Pathian ih hmaiah zoso a ding thei ding? Kan hnenih a um nawn lonak dingah khuitawk ah so kan kuat ding?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Kiriath Jearim khawpi ah mi an thlah ih, “Filistin mi pawl in Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu an rak khirh. Rung lak hram uh,” tiah thu an cah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu Kiriath Jearim khua mi pawl in an phur ih, tlang parih a ummi Abinadab ih inn ah an ret. Abinadab ih fapa Eleazar kha a kiltu dingah an fial ih Pathian hnenih pumpeknak an tuahsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiriath Jearim khua ah Bawipa ih Thukam Kuang cu kum kul lai a um. Hi sung hmuahhmuah ah Israel mi pawl in Pathian hnenah bomnak dil in an ai-hram ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Nan thinlung taktak ih Bawipa nan pan duh a si ahcun ramdang khawzing pawl le Astartes khawzingnu ih zuk pawl hi nan hlon ṭheh pei. Nan nunnak a zatein Bawipa hnenah pek ṭheh uhla amah lawng biak uh. Cuticun Filistin mi pawl ih nehnak sung ihsin Bawipa in a lo luatter ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl in Baal khawzing le Astartes khawzingnu ih zuk pawl cu an hlon ṭheh ih Bawipa lawnglawng an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl cu Mizpah khua ah tongkhawm aw dingin Samuel in a cah hai ih, “Cutawkah Pathian hnenah nan hrangah thla ka cam ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Mizpah ahcun an tong-aw khawm ṭheh. Tidai an khai ih Bawipa hnenih thawinak peknak ah tidai cu an thlet. Cule sunvu rawl an ul. “ Bawipa ih parah kan sual a si,” tiah an sual an phuang. Mizpah ah Israel mi pawl ih thu an neih mi cu Samuel in a ṭhensak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl Mizpah ih an khawm-awk ṭhehnak thu cu Filistin mi pawl in an rak theih tikah ra do dingah Filistin ih lal panga le an ralkap pawl cu an pok. Cuih thu cu Israel mi pawl in an theih tikah an ṭih ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuel hnenah, “Filistin pawl ih kut sungin in run suak theinak dingah Bawipa kan Pathian hnenah cat loin thlacam aw,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in tuu faate a that ih a pum in mei-ur thawinak ah Bawipa hnenah a pek. Israel mi bawm dingah Bawipa hnenah Samuel in thla a cam ih a thlacamnak cu Bawipa in a theih sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel in thawinak a pek rero laifangah rin lopi in Filistin mi pawl in an run nam ciamco. Cutikah Bawipa in van ihsin khawripi in a ron tlir durdo ih Filistin mi pawl cu thinphang in an buai ih an tlan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuvete in Israel mi pawl cun Filistin mi pawl cu Mizpah ihsin Bethkar thleng tiang an dawi hai. An dawinak lamtluan ah Filistin mi pawl cu an that phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Samuel in lungto a lak ih Mizpah le Shen khua karlak ah a phun ih, “ Bawipa in lamzin tluan in bawm a si,” a ti ih “Ebenezer,” tiah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutiin Filistin mi cu ral an sung ih Samuel ih nunsung hmuahhmuah Israel ram do thei lo dingah Bawipa in a kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ekron le Gath khua karlak ih a ummi khua hmuahhmuah Filistin mi pawl ih an lonmi khua pawl cu Israel mi hnenah an pek sal ih cuticun Israel mi in an ram hmuahhmuah cu an ngah sal a si. Cule Israel mi le Kanaan mi karlak khalah remnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel cu a nunsung hmuahhmuah Israel uktu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumtin tein Bethel, Gilgal le Mizpah ah a feh ih thubuainak a ummi pawl thu a ṭhensak vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Ramah khua ih a inn ah a kirsal ṭheu ih Ramah khalah cun Israel pawl ih thuṭhentu a ṭuan. Cule Ramah khua ah Bawipa hrangah biakṭheng a don.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel cu a tar thlang ih curuangah a fapa tla cu Israel mi lakih thuṭhentu a ṭuanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A fapa upa cu Joel a si ih a nauta cu Abijah a si. Beersheba khua ah thuṭhentu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain an pa ih nuncan vekin an nung thei lo. Paisa ngahnak lawng an ruat ih curuangah nawhthuh tla an lak ih dingthluk lairelnak thawn thu an ṭhen lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Israel hruaitu pawl cu an tongkhawm aw ih Samuel hnenah Ramah ah an feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a hnenah, “Zohhnik, nang le na tar zo ih na fapa pawl in na nuncan an thlun fawn lo. Curuangah miphun dang pawl ih an neih vekin in uktu dingah siangpahrang in pe aw,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiih siangpahrang an dil cu a lung a kim lo ruangah Samuel cu Bawipa hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Na hnenih an simmi thu hmuahhmuah hi ngai ko aw. Nangmah an lo hnong a si lo. Keimah an siangpahrang in hnong sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin ka suahpi ihsin thokin tuihsun ni tiangah ka hnen ihsin an tlan ih khawzing dangdang an bia ringring. Ka parih an tuah ringring mi atu na parah an tuah ve thlang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah an thu ngai ko aw. Asinain ziangvek in an siangpahrang in an uk ding, ti kimtein an hnenah sim cia awla ralrinnak tla feltein pe cia hai aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang a diltu Israel mi pawl hnenah Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu Samuel in a sim thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hnenah, “Hi vek in nan siangpahrang in a lo uk ding: Nan fapa pawl cu a ralkap ah a tuah ding; a hrek cu raldonak rangleng mawngtu ah an cang ding. A hrek cu a rang ralkap ah an cang ding. A hrek cu rangleng hmai ih tlantu ralkap an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hrek cu a ralkap thawngkhat uktu ralbawi an si dingih a hrekkhat cu ralkap sawmnga uktu an si ding. Nan fapa pawl hrekkhat cu a siangpahrang ih lothlotu an si dingih a lo sungih rawl khawmtu, a hriamnam tuahtu le a raldonak rangleng pawl ih thilri tuahtu an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan fanu pawl a hrangah rimhmui an tuah a ṭul ding ih a rawl suangtu le a sangrawhtu tla an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan lo lakih a ṭha bik, nan sabit hmuan lakih a ṭhabik le nan olif hmuan lakih a ṭha bik pawl cu nan siangpahrang in a lo lak sak pei ih a kuthnuai bawi pawl a ṭhen thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan khawmmi rawl le sabit sung ihsin ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat a lak pei ih a zung hnaṭuan bawi pawl le a bawi dang pawl a ṭhen thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nan hnen-um pawl nunau siseh mipa siseh a lak ih tlunah nan caw le nan rang lakih a ṭha bik pawl a lak pei ih amah hrangih hnaṭuantu ah a tuah thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nan ṭilva sung khalin ṭhenhra ṭhenkhat a lak ding. Nanmah khal a sal ah nan cang thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuvek tikcu a hung thlen ngaingai tikah nan lungtho ih nan hrilmi siangpahrang ruangah nan phunzai ciamco leh ding; asinain nan phunzainak cu Bawipa in a lo theih sak lo ding a si,” tiah Samuel in a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Samuel ih thu cu an ngai duh lo. “Asilo, siangpahrang kan duh hrimhrim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kanmah ih siangpahrang in in uk dingih kan ral pawl donak ah in ho ding. Cuticun miphun dang bangtuk kan si ve ding,” tiah an ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Misenpi pawl ih simmi thu cu kimtein Samuel in a ngai ih Bawipa a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “An duh mi cu tuah ko awla siangpahrang cu pe hai aw,” tiah a ti. Cuih hnuah Israel mi pawl cu Samuel in an inn ciarah a tlunter thluh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin ramah Kish an timi pa pakhat a um. Amah cu Abiel ih fapa a si. Abiel cu Zeror ih fapa a si. Zeror cu Bekorath ih fapa a si. Bekorath cu Afiah ih fapa a si ih Afiah cu Benjamin phun a si. Kish cu milian le mi ih upat mi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kish in Saul timi fapa a nei. Saul cu a sanṭhat laifang a si ih a piangzet fawn. Israel mi pawl hmuahhmuah lakah a piang bik a si ih mi dang hnakin pi khat a sang fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pa Kish ih laak hrekkhat pawl cu an vakhlo ih curuangah a pa in, “Kan hnen-um pakhat hruai awla kan laak pawl va hawl uh,” tiah Saul cu a fial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Efraim tlangpar ram le Shalishah ramah an feh ih an hawl naón an hmu lo. Shaalim peng sungah a ram pumpi in an hawl naón laak cu an um lo. Cuih hnuah Benjamin ram sungah an hawl ih an hmu cuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuf peng sung an thlen tikah Saul in, “Kan tlung thlang pei. Ziangahtile laak thu ruat loin ka pa in kanmah riangri tla in helhkamter pang ding,” tiah a hnen-um pa hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah a hnen-um pa in, “Um hrihhnik; hih khua ah hin Pathian ih minung pakhat a um ih mi in an upat zetmi a si; ziangahtile a simmi hmuahhmuah a dik ṭheu. A hnenah kan va feh pei ih kan laak pawl umnak tla in sim thei men ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kan va feh asile ziangso kan pek ding? Kan zaal sungah rawl a um nawn lo, zianghman pek ding kan neih ual lo,” tiah Saul in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnen-um pa in, “Ngun tangka fangkhat ka pai ih cumi ka pek pei. Kan laak pawl an umnak in sim ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Culai ahcun mi pakhat in Pathian hnenih sut duhmi a neih tikah, “Hmutu hnenah kan feh pei,” tiah a ti ṭheu. Ziangahtile cuih san ahcun profet cu hmutu tiah an rak ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Na ruahnak a ṭha a si. Kan feh pei,” a ti ih Pathian ih minung pa umnak khua ahcun an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An khuataw so an soh rero laifangah tidai khai dingih a rami fala pawl an tong. “Nan khawsung ih hmutu a um maw?” tiah fala pawl cu an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fala pawl cun, “A um sokhaw! Nan hlan deuhte ah a ra thleng. Zamrang uhla nan hei man ding. Khawsung mi pawl in tuihsun tlangpar ih biakṭheng ah khawrai thawinak an pek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawsung nan luh vete in tlangpar ih rawl ei ding a feh hlanah nan tong ko ding. Tlangpar ih amah a thlen lo ahcun misenpi pawl rawl an ei lo ding; ziangahtile khawrai thawinak cu amah in thla a cam hmaisa ding ih cuih hnu lawngah senpi cu rawl an ei ding. Atu-ah feh uhla hmakhatte-ah nan tong ko ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuticun an feh ih khawsung an luh zawng ah Samuel cu biaknak hmun ih feh dingin a ra suah kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul a thlen ni ih a mizan sun ah Bawipa in Samuel hnen ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Thaisun atu tikcu ah Benjamin phun ihsin mipa pakhat na hnenah ka rak thlah ding. Ka minung Israel pawl uktu ah amah cu hriakculh awla Filistin pawl ih kut ihsin a humhim hai ding. Ka minung pawl ih tuarnak le zonzaihnak ka hmu zo ih bomnak dilih an aihramnak ka thei zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel in Saul cu a hmuh tikah, Bawipa in Samuel hnenah, “Ka lo timi cu hi pa hi a si. Ka minung pawl amah in a uk ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Saul cu Samuel hnenah kotka kiangah a va feh ih, “Khuiah so hmutu pa ih inn a um, i sim hram aw,” tiah a va ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel cun, “Keimah hi hmutu cu ka si. Biaknak hmunah ka hmaiah feh aw. Tuihsun ah nan pahnih in ka hnenah rawl nan ei ding. Thaizing ah nan thusuh duhmi hmuahhmuah ka lo let pei ih cuih hnuah nan fehnak dingah ka lo thlah leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An hlohnak ni thum a si zomi nan laak pawl cu helhkam duh hlah uh, ziangahtile an hmu zo. Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl ih an ṭul zetmi cu zoso a si? Nangmah na si! Nangmah le na pa ih hrin pawl nan si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul in, “Kei cu Benjamin phun ka si; Israel miphun lakah phun fate bikmi ka si. Cun kan phunkhat sungah kannih sung cu santlai lo bik sung kan si fawn. Curuangah ziangtinso hiti in ka hnenah na ṭong?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in Saul le a hnen-um pa cu rawl einak khaan tumpi sungah a hruai ih, an sawmmi minung sawmthum tluk an tonak cabuaipi ih lu lamah a toter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Samuel in rawl suang pa ih hnenah, “A dangte ih ka lo rettermi sa kha rak keng aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule rawl suang pa cun sacawn le a kopmi thau pawl a hun suah ih Saul ih hmaiah cun a ret. Samuel in, “Himi cu nangmah hrangih retmi a si. Ei aw, ka sawmmi pawl thawn ei tlang dingah na hrangih retmi a si,” tiah a ti. Cuticun cuih ni ah Saul cu Samuel hnenah rawl a ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biaknak hmun ihsin khawsungih an vung kirsal tikah inn diphun parah Saul ih ihnak an tuah ih, cutawkah Saul cu a it.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zingpit ah an tho ih Samuel in Saul cu a hun ko ih, “Tho awla na fehnak ding zinah ka lo thlah ding,” a ti. Saul cu a tho ih Samuel thawn hmun khatah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khawhnar an thlen tikah Samuel in, “Na hnen-um pa hi hmaiah rak fehter aw,” tiah Saul cu a ti. Hnen-um pa cu hmaiah a rak feh. Cutikah Samuel in, “Malte in taangta hrih awla Pathian ih ṭong mi ka lo sim ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Samuel in olif hriak palang khat a lak ih Saul ih lu parah a toih ih Saul cu a hnam hnuah, “ Bawipa in a miphun Israel pawl uktu dingah nangmah cu hriak a lo culh a si. A minung pawl na uk ding ih an ral pawl ih kutsung ihsin na luatter ding. Amah ih minung pawl uk dingah Bawipa in a lo hril zo a si, ti theihthiamnak cu hi bangtuk in a si ding:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuihsun kan ṭhen awk hnuah Benjamin ram sungih a ummi Zelzah khua ih Rachel ih thlaan kiangah mi pahnih na tong ding. Nan hawl rero mi laak pawl cu an hmu zo ih na pa cu laak hrangah helhkam nawn loin nangmah a lo helhkam ih, ‘Ka fapa hrangah ziangso ka tuah ding?’ tiah atu le atu mi a sut leuhleuh, tiah an lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutawk ihsin na feh ding ih Tabor an timi hmunih sasuapi kung na thlen tikah Bethel khua ah Pathian hnenih saserh thawinak pe dingah a fehmi pacang pathum na tong ding. Pakhat pa cun me faate pathum a hruai ding ih, pahnihnak pa in sang zawl thum a keng ding. A pathumnak pa cun savun thawl khatin sabitti a keng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An lo cibai ding ih sang zawl hnih an lo pe ding. Cumi cu na rak sang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Filistin ralkap pawl ih riahbuk umnak Gibeah khua ih a ummi Pathian Tlangah na feh pei. Khawsung vung luhnak hnar ah, tlangpar biakṭheng ihsin profet burpi, ṭingṭang le khuang, phirivau le tingrisit pawl tum phah in a rung tlungmi na tong ding. Anmah tla cu profet ṭong in an ṭong ding ih an laam an au phahphah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Pathian ih thlarau in a lo kai ve ding; anmah bangtuk in profet ṭong in na ṭong ve ding; na laam na au phahphah ve ding ih mi phundangpi ah na cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cu bangtuk ih na parih a kim ṭheh tikah Pathian ih a lo hruainak bangtuk in tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hlanah Gilgal ah na rak feh pei. Cutawkah ka lo tong ding, mei-ur thawinak le rem-awk thawinak pawl tla Pathian hnenah ka pek ding. Ka ra thlen hlan lo ni sarih sung i hngak awla cuih hnuah na tuah ding mi ka lo sim ding,” tiah Samuel in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul cu feh dingih a vung her-awk laiah Pathian in Saul cu thinlung thar a pek. Samuel ih a simmi hmuahhmuah kha cuih ni ah a kim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul le a hnen-um pa cu Gibeah an thlen tikah profet pawl in an rak tong. Pathian ih thlarau in Saul cu a kaiih profet pawl bang in profet ṭong in a ṭong ih a laam a au phahphah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hlanih a rak theitu pawl in Saul khal cuti ih a um cu an hmuh tikah, “Kish fapa hi ziang a cang a si pei? Saul khal profet a cang zo maw si?” tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutawk khua ih a ummi pacang pakhat in, “Midang profet pawl teh, an pale pawl profet an si ciar maw si?” tiah a ti. Cuticun, “Saul khal profet a cang zo maw si?” tihi ṭongnak ah an hmang ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul cu profet pawl vekih a laam le a au a reh tikah tlangpar ih biakṭheng ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A paseu in Saul le a hnen-um pa cu, “Khuiah so nan si?” tiah a rak sut. Cutikah Saul in, “Kan laak pawl kan hawl. Kan hmuh lo tikah Samuel kan va tong,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Samuel in ziangso a lo sim?” tiah a paseu in a sut sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Laak pawl cu an hmu zo a si, tiah in sim,” tiah a ti. Siangpahrang na cang ding tiih Samuel ih a simmi pawl cu a paseu hnenah a sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Mizpah ah, Bawipa ih hnenah, Samuel in a kokhawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Samuel in an hnenah, “ Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian in, ‘Izipt ram ihsin ka lo suahter ih Izipt mi pawl le a lo hremtu pawl ih kut sung ihsin ka lo luatter a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keimah cu nan harsatnak le nan zonzaihnak sung ihsin a lo runtu nan Pathian ka si. Sikhalsehla tuihsun ah kei cu in hnong ih siangpahrang in dil. Curuangah nan phun ciar le nan hrin ciar in ka hmaiah hin ding hnik uh,’ a ti,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule an phunhnam ciar in phunkhat hnu phunkhat Samuel in hmailamah a suahter hai ih Bawipa in Benjamin phun a hril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Benjamin phun sung ihsin hrinkhat hnu hrinkhat Samuel in a dinter tikah Matri ih hrin kha Bawipa in a hril. Cule Matri ih hrin pawl cu an mipum in hmailam ih an ra suah tikah Kish ih fapa Saul a hril. Asinain Saul cu an hawl ih an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi dang hril ding an um maw?” tiah Bawipa cu an sut. Cutikah Bawipa in, “Khinah Saul a um ko; thilri lakah a relh a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah an va tlan ih Saul cu mipi hmaiah an rak suahpi. Midang lakih a din tikah midang hnakin pi khat in a sang deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Pathian ih a hrilmi cu hi pa hi a si. Kanmah lakah amah bangtuk zohman kan um lo,” tiah a ti. Cutikah mi hmuahhmuah in, “Siangpahrang a san sauseh!” tiah an au hluarhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siangpahrang ih covo le ṭuanvo pawl cu Israel mi pawl hnenah Samuel in feltein a simfiang ih cazual sungih a ngan hnuah a cuih cazual cu hmun thianghlim ah a ret. Cuih hnuah misenpi cu an inn ciarah a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul khal Gibeah ih a inn ah a tlung ve. Pathian ih an thinlung a tong ngahmi micak le ralṭhazet hrekkhat pawl in Saul cu a inn ah an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain mi hlolak hrekkhat cun, “Hi pa cun ziangtinso in run thei ding?” tiah an ti. Saul cu an nautat ih laksawng khal an pe duh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla khat tluk a rei tikah Ammon siangpahrang Nahash cu Gilead ram sungih a ummi Jabesh khua do dingin a feh. Nahash ih ralkap pawl in Jabesh khua cu an kulh thluh. Curuangah Jabesh khawsungmi pawl in Nahash hnenah, “Lungkimnak cakhen kan tuah pei ih in uktu ah kan lo hmang ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Nahash cun, “Nan vorhlam mit ciar ka lo phorh thluh ih Israel miphun parih ningzahnak ka thlenter hnu lawngah nanmah thawn lungkimnak cakhen ka tuah thei ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Jabesh khua ih hotu pawl in, “Israel ramsung hmuahhmuah ih mi kan thlah theinak dingah ni sarih sung tikcu in pe hram aw. Zohman in in bawm lo ding asile na hnenah kan lut ko ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thlahmi pawl cu Saul umnak khua Gibeah an va thleng ih an thuhla an sim tikah khawsungmi pawl cu riahsia in an ṭap ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Culaifang ah Saul cu lo ihsin a caw pawl thawn a rung tlung. Cule Saul in, “Ziang thupoi so a um? Ziangah so mikip ih an ṭah ciamco?” tiah a sut. Jabesh khua ihsin an rak thlahmi palai pawl ih thusia cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A cuih thu cu Saul in a theih tikah Pathian ih thlarau in a kaiih a thin cu meisa alh in a alh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cawcang pahnih a that ih an sa a satcip hnuah Israel ramsung hmuahhmuah ih fehpi dingah mi a thlah ih, “Ral donak ah Saul le Samuel a thlun lotu pa ih cawcang cu hi vekin can ṭheh a si ve pei,” tiah thu a cah thluh. Bawipa in ziangtin in tuah pei, tiah Israel mi pawl cun an ṭih ih an zatein thinlung khatein an suak khawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul in Bezek ah a hruai khawm ih Israel mi thawng zathum an ti ih, Judah mi thawng sawmthum an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jabesh khua ihsin an rak thlah mi palai pawl hnenah, “Nan khuami pawl va sim uh: thaisun sun hlanah runsuak an si ding,” tiah an ti. A cuih thu an theih tikah Jabesh khuami cu an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Nahash hnenah, “Thaisun cu na hnenah kan ra lut pei ih na duh vekin in tuah a si ko pei cu,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thaizing ah Saul in a ralkap pawl cu bu thum ah a ṭhen ih zingthlapit ah an ral pawl cu an riahnak ah an nam ciammam. Sun a hung si tikah Ammon mi pawl cu an that thluh. A luatmi hnihkhat pawl cu an ṭhendarh-aw thluh ih a dang ciarah an tlanhlo ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Israel mi pawl in Samuel hnenah, “Saul kan siangpahrang si hlah seh, a titu kha zoso an si? Kan hnenah in pe awla kan that thluh ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain Saul in, “Tuihsun ah zohman nan that lo pei, ziangahtile tuihsun cu Bawipa in Israel a runsuak ni a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Samuel in, “Kan zate in Gilgal ah kan feh pei ih Saul kan siangpahrang a si, tiah kan hngetter sal pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah an zatein Gilgal ah an feh ih cutawk hmun Bawipa ih hmai ahcun Saul cu siangpahrang ah an hngetter. Rem-awk thawinak tla Bawipa ih hnenah an pek ih Saul le Israel mi pawl cu lungawizet in puai an tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in Israel mi pawl hnenah, “ṭuan dingih in fialmi cu kan ṭuan zo. Nanmah a lo uktu dingah siangpahrang ka ret zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lo hruaitu dingah nanmah ih ta a si zo. Kei cu ka tar zo ih ka ṭuak khal a par ṭheh zo. Ka fapa pawl khal nan lakah an tel a si. Ka no lai ihsin atu tiang nan hotu ka si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atu-ah nan hmaika ah ka um. Thilsual ka tuah mi pakhatkhat a um asile Bawipa Pathian le amah ih hrilmi siangpahrang ih hmaiah atu-ah nan lungkim lonak phuang uh. Mi caw ka la dah maw? Mi laak ka ru dah maw? Mi pakhatkhat ka bum in ka neh-nen dah maw? Zo ih hnenin nawhthuh ka la dah maw? A dik loih ka lakmi a um a si ahcun ka lakmi zat in ka sam sal ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Israel mi pawl in, “Zohman in bum lo; in neh-nen lo ih zohnen hmanin zianghman na la dah lo,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Samuel in, “Tuihsun ih mawhnak nei loih in hmuhnak ahhin in theihpitu cu Bawipa Pathian le amah ih hrilmi siangpahrang an si,” tiah a ti. Cutikah annih in, “ Bawipa cu in theihpitu a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Samuel in, “Moses le Aaron a hriltu le nan pupa pawl Izipt ram ihsin a suaktertu cu Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah nan umnak ciarah ding uhla nanmah le nan pupa pawl run dingah Bawipa ih mangbangza thil a tuahmi pawl ka lo sim ding ih Bawipa ih hmaiah nan sualnak ka phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jakob le a sungkhat pawl Izipt ramih an thlen tikah Izipt mi pawl in an hrem ruangah Bawipa ih hnenah bomnak dil in an au. Bawipa in an aunak cu a thei ih Moses le Aaron a thlah ih anmah in nan pupa pawl cu Izipt ram ihsin an suahpi ih hi ram ahhin an thlenpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa an Pathian an hngilh ruangah Pathian in Hazor khua ih ralkap pawl hotu ralbawi Sisera le Filistin mi pawl le Moab siangpahrang pawl kha Israel a doter ih a nehter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Bawipa hnenah bomnak dil in an au lala ih ‘Maw Bawipa , na lamzin ihsin kan pial ih Baal khawzing le Astartes khawzingnu pawl kan bia. Kan sual a si. Asinain kan ral pawl ih kutsung ihsin in luatter hram awla nangmah kan lo bia ding,’ an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa in Jerub-baal, Barak, Jefthah le Samuel pawl a thlah ih nan ral pawl ih kutsung ihsin an lo run ih hnangam zetin nan um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Ammon siangpahrang Nahash in in do ding ti nan theih vete in Bawipa cu nan siangpahrang si dingah nan duh nawn lo ih, ‘In uktu dingah siangpahrang in pe aw,’ tiah in dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atu-ah nan hrilmi siangpahrang a um zo. Nan dilmi a si ih Bawipa in a lo pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah nanmah le nan siangpahrang in Bawipa nan Pathian cu nan thlun, a thu khal nan ngai, a thupekmi bangtuk in nan tuah ih amah ṭihzah upatnak in a hna khal nan ṭuan a si ahcun a ṭha ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa thu nan ngai duh loih a thupekmi tla nan el a si ahcun, nan pupa pawl ih an rak tuar bangin, nanmah le nan siangpahrang in nan tuar ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah nan umnak hmun ciarah ding uhla Bawipa ih thil makzet a tuah dingmi hi zohhnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atu hi ṭhal tikcu a si lo maw? Thla ka cam pei ih Bawipa in khua a ritter ding ih ruah a surter ding. Cumi cu nan hmuh tikah Bawipa hnenih siangpahrang nan dil ruangah hin Pathian hnenah sualnak tumzet nan tuah a si, ti cu fiangtein nan thei ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in thla a cam ih cuih ni rori ah Pathian in khua a ritter ih ruah khal a surter. Cule mi hmuahhmuah in Bawipa le Samuel cu an ṭihzet ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel hnenah, “Kan thih lonak dingah zaangfahteón Bawipa na Pathian hnenah thla in cam sak hram aw. Kan sualnak siar cawk loih tlunah siangpahrang kan dil ruangah hin kan sual bet a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Nan thin phang hlah uh. Thil ṭha lo nan tuah zo naón Bawipa ih hnen ihsin pial nawn hlah uh. Nan thinlung zatein amah ih hna ṭuan sawn uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian lem pawl hnenah feh hlah uh. Annih pawl cun an lo bawm loih an lo run thei fawn lo, ziangahtile annih cu a lem an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian cun a hmin sal in thu a lo kam ih ziangtik hmanah a lo taan lo ding; ziangahtile amah ih minung si dingah a lo tumtah cia zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei cu ziangtik hmanah nan hrangih thlacam ka cawl lo ding; ka cawl asile Bawipa ih hmaiah misual ka si ding. A ṭha mi le a dikmi pawl tuah dingah ka lo zirh sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa cu ṭihzah uhla rinsantlak zetin nan thinlung zate thawn amah ih hna ṭuan uh. Nan hrangih thilmak zetzet a tuah mi pawl ziangtik hmanah hngilh hlah uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sikhalsehla thil ṭha lo nan tuah thotho a si ahcun nan zatein nan siangpahrang thawn siatsuah thluh nan si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul cu siangpahrang a can tikah kum … sawmthum a ti ih Israel siangpahrang kum … sawmli hnih sung a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul in Israel mi pawl sung ihsin minung thawngthum a hril ih midang pawl cu an inn ah a tlunter. Minung thawnghnih Bethel tlangram ih Mikmash an timi hmunah amah hnenah a ret. Cun a dang thawngkhat cu Benjamin ram Gibeah khua, a fapa Jonathan hnenah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Geba khua ah Jonathan in Filistin ralbawipa a that ih cuih thu cu Filistin mi pawl in an thei thluh. Cutikah Saul in Hebru mi pawl raltho dingih ko dingah mi a thlah ih a ramsung hmuahhmuah ah tawtawrawt tum in an feh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistin ralbawipa Saul in a that ti in le Israel mi cu Filistin mi pawl in an nautat zet a si, tiah Israel mi hmuahhmuah hnenah an sim thluh. Curuangah raltho dingih kawh an si tikah Saul hnen Gilgal khua ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel mi pawl do dingah Filistin mi pawl cu an pum-aw ciammam ih raldonak rangleng thawng sawmthum, rang ralkap thawngruk le tifinriat kapih vunnel zat ralkap an khawm aw. Beth-aven ihsin nisuahnak lamih a ummi Mikmash ah an feh ih cutawkah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu nasazet in an do. Filistin mi pawl an cak deuh ruangah Israel mi pawl cu an van a sang ih a hrekkhat cu lungpuk le lungkua ah, a hrekkhat cu lungphen le leilungkua le tikhur sung tla ah an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hrekkhat cu Jordan tiva an tan ih Gad le Gilead ram tla an thleng. Saul cu Gilgal ah a um ih amah thawn a ummi pawl cu an thinphang in an thir thlohthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuel in hngak dingih a tiamta vekin ni sarih sung Saul cun a hngak; asinain Samuel cu Gilgal ah a thleng dah lo. Saul cu a minung pawl in an tlansan rero thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah an hnenah Saul in, “Mei-ur thawinak le remnak thawinak pawl rak keng hnik uh,” a ti. An rak ken tikah amah in thawinak cu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pek ṭheh vete in Samuel cu a ra thleng. Samuel a rat vete in Saul cun va hmuak dingah a pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Samuel in, “Ziang so na rak tuah?” tiah a ti. Cutikah Saul in, “Ka ra thleng ding, na ti tikcu ah na thleng lo ih ka milai pawl in in tlansan deuhdeuh ih tlunah Filistin mi pawl Mikmash ah an khawm-aw ciamco fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Filistin mi pawl in Gilgal ah in do ding tin ka zum ih Pathian ih bomnak le ka dil hrih lo ruangah thawinak ka pek lo ahcun a cang thei nawn lo a si, ka ti ih keimah tein thawinak ka rak pek a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Na tuah mi hi aatthlak a si. Bawipa na Pathian ih thupekmi na thlun lo a si. Rak thlun cila nangmah le na tesinfa pawl hi Pathian in a kumkhua in Israel a lo ukter ding naón.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu cu na uknak hi rei a awh lo ding. Pathian in amah ih duhmi minung a hawl ding ih a minung pawl uktu dingah a tuah ding. Ziangahtile Bawipa ih thu na ngai lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel cu Gilgal ihsin a feh. Midang hmuahhmuah in Saul an thlun ih a ralkap pawl hnenah Saul le mipi cu an feh. Gilgal ihsin Benjamin ramih a ummi Gibeah ah an feh. Saul in a ralkap pawl cu a khawm ih zaruk an kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul le a fapa Jonathan le an ralkap pawl cu Benjamin ramsung Geba khua ah an riak. Filistin pawl cu Mekmash ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Filistin ralkap pawl cu raldo dingih an feh tikah bur thum in an ṭhen aw. Bur khat cu Shual ram Ofrah khua lamah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bur hnihnak cu Beth Horon khua lamah an feh ih, bur thumnak cu Zeboiim phairawn ihsin khatlam ral thlaler ramṭhing lamah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A cuihsan laiah Israel ramsungah sodeng pakhat hman an um lo; ziangahtile Filistin mi pawl in nam le fei pawl ser lo dingin Hebru mi pawl cu an kham.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Israel mi pawl cu an tuhmui, an tupheng, an hreitlung le an namtong pawl hriam ko ih ser dingah Filistin mi pawl hnenah an fehpi ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hreitlung le namtong ser man cu ngun tangka tamat a si ih, tuhmui le tupheng ser man cu ngun tangka ngamu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah ral an do awk tikah Israel mi sungah Saul le a fapa Jonathan siar lo, zohman fei le nam kengtu an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Mikmash lamzin kiltu dingah Filistin pawl in ralkap bur khat an thlah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nikhat cu Jonathan in a hriamnam kengtu tlangval pa ih hnenah, “Filistin pawl ih riahnak lamah kan va feh hnik pei,” tiah a ti. A cuih thu cu Jonathan in a pa a sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul cu Gibeah kiangte Migron khua ih tale kung tumpi hnuai ah a riak. A hnenah ralkap zaruk an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun puithiam ṭaangthlaih angki a kengtu cu Ahitub ih fapa Ahijah a si; Ahitub cu Ikhabod ih unau a si ih Ikhabod cu Finehas ih fapa a si. Finehas cu Shiloh khua ih Bawipa ih puithiam Eli ih fapa a si. Cutawkih a ummi ralkap pawl cun Jonathan a feh zo ti kha an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistin ralkap pawl ih riahnak ah feh dingin Jonathan ih a zawh ding mi tlangkawn ih khatlam veve ah a zumzetmi lungtumpi pahnih an um. Lungto pakhat ih hmin cu Bozez an ti ih a dang pakhat cu Seneh an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bozez cu lamzin saklam, Mikmash lamah a um ih, Seneh cu lamzin ih thlanglam, Geba lam kapah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan in tlangval pa ih hnenah, “Pathian awi lo Filistin ralkap pawl ih riahnak ah kan va feh pei. Pathian in in bawm men ding. In bom ngaingai ahcun ziangtlukih mi malte kan si hmanah kan neh thotho hai ding. Bawipa ih in bomnak cu zohman in an kham thei zik lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tlangvalpa cun, “Na tummi cu tuah ko aw; na hnenah ka thinlung zatein ka ṭang a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Jonathan in, “A ṭha! Kan va feh pei ih in rak hmu hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘In rak hngak uh, nan hnenah kan ra ding,’ in ti a si ahcun hi tawk ihsin kan hngak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘Kan hnenah hung uh,’ in ti a si ahcun kan hung feh pei; ziangahtile ‘Hung uh,’ in tile cu Pathian bomnak in kan neh ding ti langnak a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Filistin mi pawl ih hmuh dingin an lang-awter ih cutikah Filistin mi pawl cun, “Zohhnik uh, an relhnak lungkua sungin Hebru mi a hrekkhat an ra pawt zo khi,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Filistin ralkap pawl cun Jonathan le a hriamnam kengtu tlangvalpa cu, “Hinah hung hnik uh. Thu lo sim ding kan nei a si,” tiah an ti. Cutikah Jonathan in a tlangvalpa hnenah, “I thlun zaang aw. Pathian in nehnak in pe zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jonathan cu bokvak in a hung vak ih tlangvalpa cun a thlun vivo. Jonathan in Filistin pawl cu a nam ih a vuak thlak ih tlangvalpa in a that vivo hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmaisa bikih an thahnak hmun inn hmun tia tlukah Jonathan le a tlangvalpa in Filistin mi pawl kul tluk an that a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Filistin mi hmuahhmuah in an thin a phang ngaingai ih ralvengtu ralkap le riahnak ih a ummi ralkap pawl tla an khur ṭheh. Leilung tiangin a hnin ih Filistin mi pawl cu ṭih le khur in an buai ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin ram, Gibeah khua ih Saul ih ralvengtu pawl in Filistin mi suk le so ih an tlan rero kha an hmuh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul in, “Ralkap pawl, siar-aw hnik uh; a kim lo nan um maw!” tiah a ti. An siar-awk tikah Jonathan le a hriamnam kengtu tlangvalpa an um lo ti kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in puithiam Ahijah hnenah, “Puithiam ṭaangthlaih angki cu hinah rak keng aw,” tiah a fial. Ziangahtile Israel mi hmai ih puithiam angki kengtu cu amah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiam Ahijah hnenih Saul a ṭong rero laiah Filistin ralkap pawl cu an riahnak ahcun an buai sinsin. Curuangah Saul in Ahijah hnenah, “Na aizing cu bangta hrih aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Saul le a ralkap pawl cu hmakhatte-ah Filistin mi do dingah an feh. Filistin pawl cu an buaituk thlang ih an minung khal thei-aw nawn loin anmah le anmah an that-aw rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Filistin pawl hnenih a rak ṭangtu Hebru mi pawl tla Saul le Jonathan an hmuh tikah an hnenah an let-aw sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Efraim tlangram ah a tlan ih a relhmi Israel ralkap pawl tla Filistin mi an sung ti an theih tikah Saul le Jonathan hnenah an ṭang sal ih Filistin mi pawl cu an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A cuih ni ah Israel cu Bawipa in a runsuak ih Israel mi pawl in Bethaven khua lan tiang an hei dawi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul in, “Ka ral pawl parih phu ka lak hlan lo, tuihsun ah zohman rawl nan ei lo pei. Nan ei asile nan buarsual a si ding,” tiah siatcam in thu a pek. Curuangah cuih ni cu Israel mi pawl an ril a rawng ngaingai ih an ṭaamsawl thluh. Sunvu zianghman an ei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tupi sung an thleng ih cutawkah khuaitizu tampi a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tupi sung cu khuaitizu in a khat naón Saul ih siatcamnak an ṭih ruangah zohman in an ei ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jonathan in a pa ih siatcamnak thupekmi cu a theih lo ruangah a kenmi fung cun khuaithlar cu a dawt ih khuaitizu malte a ei. Cuticun a rilrawn cu a ṭha deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cumi a hmuh tikah ralkap pa pakhat in, “Zokhal rawl kan ei lo ruangah tha kan nei nawn lo a si. Na pa in, ‘Tuihsun ih rawl a eitu cu siatserh siseh,’ a ti ruangah kan ei ngam lo a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah Jonathan in, “Kan minung parah ka pa in thil ṭha lo ngaingai a tuah a si. Zohhmen uh, khuaitizu ka ei ruangah ka ṭha deuh ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuihsun Filistin pawl an neh ih rawl an lon mi hmuahhmuah kha lak tahratin ei hai sehla ziangtlukin an hrangah a ṭhahnem ding. Ziangtluk in so Filistin mi an that tam sinsin ding, ruathnik hmen uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A cuih ni ah Israel mi pawl in Filistin mi pawl cu Mikmash ihsin Aijalon tiang an nor. Israel mi cu an ril a rawn ruangah an ṭaamsawl thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah ral pawl ih ta an lonmi tuu le caw pawl cu a hmunah an that ih an sa cu a thi thawn an ei ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule Saul hnenah, “Na ralkap pawl in a thi thawn sa an ei ciamco ih Bawipa ih hmaiah an sual a si,” tiah mi in an sim. Cutikah Saul cun, “Kan miphun zuarthlaitu nan si,” tiah a au. Cuih tlun ah, “Lungto tumpi hinah rak hril uh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Mi hmuahhmuah hnenah va feh uhla an caw le an tuu pawl hinah rak keng dingin va sim uh. Sa cu a thi thawn an ei lonak dingah le Bawipa ih hmaiah an sual lonak dingah an ṭilva cu hinah ra that hai sehla ei hai seh,” tiah a ti. Curuangah a cuih zan cu an zatein an caw an rak keng ih cutawkah cun an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Saul in biakṭheng a dawlih Bawipa hrangih a dawlmi hmaisa bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Saul in a ralkap pawl hnenah, “Kan vung feh pei ih zanah Filistin mi pawl kan vung do pei. Zinglam khawvang tiang kan vung siim ding ih kan vung that thluh hai ding,” tiah a ti. “A ṭha bik na timi poh cu tuah ko aw,” tiah an ti. Asinain puithiam in, “Pathian kan ron hmaisa hrih pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in Pathian hnenah, “Filistin pawl ka do pei maw? Kan do asile kan neh pei maw?” tiah a sut. Asinain cuih ni cu Pathian in a sawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in Israel hruaitu pawl hnenah, “Ra hnik uh, tuihsun ah ziang mawhnak so nan tuah, hawl hnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A nungmi Bawipa , Israel Runtu ih hmin in ka lo kam a si: ka fapa Jonathan hman a mawh a si ahcun thah a si pei,” tiah a ti. Midang cu zianghman an ṭong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cule Saul in, “Nan zatein khi lamah va ding uh. Kei le ka fapa Jonathan hinah kan ding pei,” a ti. “Na duh vekin si ko seh,” tiah misenpi in an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian hnenah, “ Bawipa , ziangah so tuihsun ah zianghman i sawn lo? Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, atu-ah Urim le Thummim in in run let hram aw. Keimah ih mawh, a si lole Jonathan ih mawh a si ahcun Urim in in let aw. Israel misenpi pawl an mawh a si ahcun Thummim in in let aw,” tiah a ti. Urim in a run let ruangah Jonathan le Saul cu mimawh an si ih Israel mi pawl cu mawh lo ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Keimah le ka fapa Jonathan ah zoso a mawh?” tiah a sut sal tikah Jonathan parah a tlu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cule Saul in Jonathan cu, “Ziang so na tuah sual?” tiah a sut. Cutikah Jonathan in, “Khuaitizu malte ka ei a si. Thih ding a si ahcun ka thi ko pei cu,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul in, “Nangmah na thih lo ahcun keimah hi Pathian in i run that seh,” tiah siat a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Israel mi pawl in Saul hnenah, “Israel hrangih ral a nehtu Jonathan a thi ding maw? Thi hrimhrim hlah! A lu parih samphang pakhat hman leilung parah a tla lo pei, tiah a nungmi Bawipa ih hmin in thu kan kam aw. Tuihsun ih a tuahmi cu Bawipa ih bomnak in a tuahmi a si,” tiah an ti. Cutiin Israel mi pawl in Jonathan cu thi loin an hum suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cuihhnu cun Saul in Filistin mi pawl cu dawi nawn loin a kirsan ih Filistin pawl cu an ramah an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Saul cu Israel siangpahrang a can hnuah khuazakip ah ral a do. Moab mi pawl, Ammon mi pawl le Edom mi pawl a do ih Filistin mi pawl le Zobah siangpahrang pawl tla a do. Ral a donak tinah nehtu a si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ralṭhazet in ral a do ih Amalek pawl khal a neh. Israel mi a siimtu pawl ih kut ihsin a hum ngah hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saul ih fapa pawl cu Jonathan, Ishvi le Malkhishua an si. A fanu upa sawn cu Merab a si ih a nauta sawn cu Mikhal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A nupi cu Ahimaaz ih fanu Ahinoam a si. A ralkap uktu bawi cu a paseu Ner ih fapa Abner a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Saul ih pa Kish le Abner ih pa Ner cu Abiel ih fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Saul in a nunsung hmuahhmuah nasazet in Filistin pawl a do. Micak le mi ralṭha a hmuhmi le a tonmi hmuah in a ralkap ah a lak ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel in Saul hnenah, “Pathian minung Israel mi pawl uktu siangpahrang si dingih hriak lo culhtu dingah Bawipa in i thlah zo. Curuangah Bawipa ih simmi cu ngai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl an suah laiah, Israel mi a rak dodaltu Amalek mi pawl cu Ziangkimtithei Bawipa in hrem a tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Feh awla Amalek mi pawl cu va do uh. An neihmi hmuahhmuah siatsuah thluh uh. Zianghman zuah hlah uh; mipa, nunau, nauhak le a suak pekte naute tiangin that thluh uh. Caw, tuu, kalauk le laak pawl khal that thluh uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in a ralkap pawl a ko ih Telaim ah an khawm aw. Israel ihsin ralkap thawng zahnih le Judah ihsin ralkap thawnghra an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Saul le a ralkap pawl cu Amalek khawpi lam ahcun an feh ih tiva car sung ihsin ral an bawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul in Ken mi pawl hnenah, “Izipt ram ihsin Israel mi pawl an suah laiah Israel mi parah nannih cu nan rak ṭha a si. Amalek mi pawl hnenih kan lo thah cih thluh lonak dingah Amalek mi pawl cu tlansan uhla fehsuak uh,” tiah ralrinnak a pek. Curuangah Ken mi pawl cu an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul in Amalek mi pawl cu Izipt ram nisuahnak lam Havilah ihsin Shur tiang a neh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amalek siangpahrang Agag cu a nung in a kai ih midang pawl cu a that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul le a ralkap pawl in Agag ih nunnak cu an zuah ih, a ṭha bikmi tuu le caw, tuu faate le caw faate pawl le a ṭha an timi pohpoh cu an that lo. Ṭhathnemnak nei lomi le man nei lomi hmuahhmuah cu an that thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in Samuel hnenah thu a sim sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saul hi siangpahrang ih ka canter cu ka siir aw ngaingai. A dung i tun ih ka thupek a thlun lo a si,” tiah a ti. Samuel cu a thin a heng ngaingai ih zanvarte Bawipa hnenah thla a cam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah Saul tong dingin a feh. Saul cu amah ih hmin hngilh lonak dingah lung a dawlnak Karmel khua ah a feh ih cuih hnuah Gilgal ah a feh a si, ti thu cu Samuel in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Samuel cu Saul hnenah a va thleng ih Saul cun a rak cibai ih, “ Bawipa in lo thluasuah hram seh, Samuel. Bawipa ih thupekmi ka thlun ko a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Cuti asile ziangtinso tuu a meekmi le caw a pawmi ka theih rero?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul in, “Amalek mi pawl hnen ihsin ka ralkap pawl ih an lakmi a si. Tuu siseh caw siseh a ṭha bikmi cu Bawipa na Pathian hrangih thawinak pek dingah an ret ih a dang cu kan that thluh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel in, “Cawl hrih awla mizan ah Bawipa ih thu i simmi ka lo sim pei,” tiah a ti. “I sim hnik aw,” tiah Saul in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Nangmah cun zianghman ka si lo tiah na ruat-aw ding naón Israel miphun pawl hotu na si. Bawipa in Israel siangpahrang ah hriak a lo culh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun mi siava Amalek mi pawl that thluh dingah Bawipa in thu a lo pek ih an zate ih na thah thluh hlan lo do dingin feltein a lo tiam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuti asinain ziangah so a thu na ngai lo? Ziangah so thilri lonmi pawl cuh dingah zamrang sawn in na pan ih Bawipa ih lungkim lomi cu na tuah?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul in, “ Bawipa ih thu ka ngai ko sokhaw! I fial vekin ka feh ih Amalek siangpahrang Agag lawng a nungin ka rak thlenpi. Midang hmuahhmuah cu ka that ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Asinain ka ralkap pawl cun an kaihmi lakih tuu le caw ṭha bik pawl cu an that lo. Gilgal khua ah Bawipa na Pathian hnenih thawinak pek dingah an rak keng sawn a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Khuimiso Bawipa in a duh sawn? Amah ih thu thlun maw, a si lole saserh peknak le thawinak so? Tuu a ṭha bikmi thawn a hnenih raithawi hnakin amah ih thu thlun cu a ṭha sawn a si. Amah dodal cu polsia dawihmang tlukin a ṭha lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Puarthau ih nun cu milem biak tlukin a sual a si. Bawipa ih thupekmi na duh lo bangtuk in anih khal in siangpahrang ah a lo duh ve lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Ka sualzet a si. Bawipa ih thupekmi le nangmah ih thucahmi ka thlun lo. Ka milai pawl ka ṭih deuh ruangah an duhnak bangin ka thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa ka biak theinak dingah ka sualnak cu i ngaithiam hram awla ka hnenah Gilgal ah kirsal aw, tiah zaangfah ka lo dil,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Samuel in, “Na hnenah ka kir sal lo ding. Bawipa ih thupekmi na duh lo ruangah nang khal Israel ih siangpahrang si dingah a lo duh nawn ve lo a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Samuel cu tlung dingin a pok. Asinain Saul in a puan in a kai ih a puan cu a tlek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “ Bawipa in tuihsun ah Israel ram uknak cu na hnen ihsin a lak ih nangmah hnakih a ṭha deuhmi hnenah a pek zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel ih sunloihmi Pathian cu thuphan a per lo ih a thin a thleng-aw rero lo. Minung a si lo ruangah a thin a thleng rero lo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule Saul in, “Ka sual zo a si. Asinain Israel mi hmuahhmuah le ka minung hruaitu pawl ih hmai talah hin i upatnak cu langter hram awla Bawipa na Pathian ka biak theinak dingah ka hnenah kir ve hram aw,” tiah a dil ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah Samuel cu Saul hnenah a kirsal ih Saul cun Bawipa cu a biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Ka hnenah siangpahrang Agag cu rak hruai uh,” tiah thu a pek. Agag cu lungawizet in Samuel ih hmaiah cun a ra ih, “Thih ding ka luat zo a si hi!” tiah amahte a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule Samuel in, “Na ralnam in nunau tampi cu faate neilo ih a tuah bangtuk in atu-ah na nu khal faate neilo ah a cang ve ding,” a ti. Cutiin Gilgal ih biakṭheng hmai rori ahcun Agag cu Samuel in a that ih a satcip ṭheh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cun Samuel cu Ramah ah a feh ih Saul cu Gibeah ih a inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Samuel cun a nunsung hmuahhmuah ah siangpahrang Saul cu a tong sal nawn lo; asinain a hrangah riahsia in a um ringring. Saul cu Israel siangpahrang ih a rak tuah ruangah Bawipa Pathian cu a siir-aw ngaingai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in Samuel hnenah, “Ziangtik tiangso Saul hrangah na riah a siat ding? Israel siangpahrang a sinak in ka hnong zo a si. Curuangah olif siti malte in la awla keng aw. Bethlehem khua ah Jesse an timi pa hnenah ka lo thlah ding. Ziangahtile a fapa pawl lakin pakhat cu siangpahrang dingah ka hril zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Cumi cu ziangtinso ka tuah ngam ding? Saul ih a theih a si ahcun i that ding a sisi,” tiah a ti. Bawipa in, “Caw faate pakhat hei hruai phah awla Bawipa hnenih thawinak pek dingah ka ra tiah ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jesse kha thawinak peknak ah sawm awla cuih hnuah na tuah ding mi cu ka lo sim ding. Hriak culh aw, ka lo timi pa cu siangpahrang si dingah hriak na culh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ih a tivek cun Samuel in a tuah ih Bethlehem ahcun a feh. Bethlehem khawsungih upa pawl cun an rak hmuak ih khur rero in, “Thu ṭha thawn in ra tlawng a si maw?” tiah an rak sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuel in, “Asi, Bawipa hnenih thawinak pe dingah ka ra a si. Thiangfai-awter uhla ka hnenah ra uh,” tiah a ti. Jesse le a fapa pawl khal thiangfai aw dingin a sim ih thawinak ahcun a sawm hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An ra thlen tikah Jesse ih fapa Eliab cu Samuel in a hmuh tikah a thinlung tein, “ Bawipa hmaiih a dingmi a fapa hi Pathian hrilmi a si rori ding,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in a hnenah, “Hi pa hi mi saangzet le mi piangzet sihmansehla zoh duh hlah. Amah cu ka hnon zomi a si, ziangahtile milai zoh daan in kei Bawipa cun ka zoh lo. Milai cun a lenglam thil nan zoh, kei cun an thinlung ka zoh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Jesse in a fapa Abinadab a ko ih Samuel hnenah cun a ratpi. Asinain Samuel in, “Asilo, anih cu Bawipa ih hrilmi asilo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jesse in a fapa Shammah a rak hruai ih Samuel in, “Anih khal Bawipa ih hrilmi a si lo,” a ti lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutiin Jesse cun a fapa pasarih pawl cu Samuel ih hmaiah a rak hruai ṭheh naón Samuel in, “Pakhat hman Bawipa ih hrilmi a si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Samuel in, “Fapa dang na nei nawn lo maw?” tiah a sut. Jesse in, “A nauta bik pa a um lai naón hramlak ah tuu a khal,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Samuel in, “Amah cu ko awla ra seh. A rat hlan lo Bawipa ih hnenah thawinak kan pe hrih lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Jesse in a ko. David cu mi piangzet, mi harhdam zet tlangval note a si ih a mitmen tla cu a ṭha ngaingai. Bawipa in Samuel hnenah, “Ka hrilmi cu amah a si, hriak culh aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel cun olif hriak a lakih a unau pawl ih hmaiah cun David cu hriak a culh. Cule Bawipa ih thlarau cu a cuih ni ihsin thokin David hnenah nasa zetin a thleng. Cuih hnuah Samuel cu Ramah ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa ih thlarau in Saul cu a tlansan ih Bawipa ih fialmi thlarau ṭha lo in a hrem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hnen-um pawl in, “Pathian ih fialmi thlarau ṭha lo in a lo hrem a si, ti kan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah bawipa, thu in pe awla ṭingṭang tum a thiam zetmi kan hawl pei. Thlarau ṭha lo in a lo kaih tikah amah cun ṭingṭang a tum pei ih na ṭha sal ding a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “ṭingṭang tum a thiam zetmi cu i hawl sak uhla rak hruai uh,” tiah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule a hnen-um pakhat pa in, “Bethlehem khuami Jesse in ṭingṭang tum thiamzet fapa pakhat a nei. Amah cu mi ralṭhazet a si ih raldo tla a thiamzet. Thusim a thiam ih a piangzet fawn. A hnenah Bawipa a um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in Jesse hnenah mi a thlah ih, “Tuu a khaltu na fapa David cu ka hnenah rak thlah hram aw,” tiah a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Jesse cun sabitti saphaw thawl khat le mete pakhat le sang an phurhter mi laak pakhat thawn David cu Saul hnenah a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David cu Saul hnenah a va thleng ih Saul ih hnaṭuantu ah a cang. Cun Saul in David cu a duhzet ih a hriamnam kengtu ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Saul in Jesse hnenah, “David cu ka duhzet a si. Ka hnenah um hrih ko seh,” tiah thu a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Pathian ih fialmi thlarau ṭha lo in Saul cu a kaiṭheu ih cuti ih a kaih tinte David in a ṭingṭang a lak ih a tum ṭheu. Cutikah thlarau ṭha lo cu a tlan sal ih Saul cu a ṭha deuh ih a dam sal ṭheu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl cu raldo dingah an ko-aw ih Judah ram Sokoh khua ah an khawm-aw. Cule Sokoh le Azekah karlak ih a ummi Efes Dammim an timi hmunah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul le Israel mi pawl cu an ko khawm-aw ih Filistin mi do dingah an timtuah-aw ih Elah Rawn ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl cu tlang pakhat parah an ṭang ih Israel mi pawl khal tlang dang pakhat parah an ṭang ve. An karlak ah horkuampi a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gath khua mi Goliath an timi pa cu Filistin mi pawl umnak ihsin Israel mi zuam dingah a ra suak. Goliath cu dong ruk le khap khat a sang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dar lukhuh a khummi le ralthuam a hrukmi pawl cu cuai sawmli le cuai ruk tluk a rit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ke pawl cu darphaw in a tuam thluh ih darih tuahmi feipi cu a liangah a pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A feipi cu a hlai lam thiamtleeng tia a si ih a feipi lu cu cuai nga lenglo a rit. A ralphaw phurh saktu ralkap pakhat cu a hmaiah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Goliath cun ding tahratin Israel mi pawl cu, “Saul ih sal rual pawl, raldo dingah maw si nan ra suah? Kei cu Filistin mi ka si ih keimah do dingah nanmah lak ihsin pakhat hril aw uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I neh ih i that a si ahcun nan salah kan cang ding; asinain ka neh ih ka that a si ahcun kan salah nan cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Atu rori-ah hin Israel ralkap pawl ka lo zuam a si. Keimah do dingah nanmah lak ihsin mi pakhat hril aw uhla ra suak seh,” tiah a auh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cumi cu Saul le a ralkap pawl ih an theih tikah an riah a sia ih an thin a phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David cu Judah ram Bethlehem khua ih Efrath mi Jesse ih fapa a si. Jesse cun fapa pariat a nei ih Saul kha siangpahrang a can tikah Jesse cu a tar zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A fapa upa pathum cu raldonak ah Saul hnenah an feh ve. A upabik cu Eliab a si. A sangtu cu Abinadab a si ih a pathumnak cu Shammah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David cu nauta bik a si. A ule pathum Saul hnenih an tel ve laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David cu a caancaan ah Bethlehem ah a va tlung ih a pa ih tuu pawl a va khal ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Israel mi pawl cu Goliath in do-aw dingah zingtin zantin ni sawmli sung a va zuam ringring hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Voikhat ah David cu a pa Jesse in, “Vaikan bawm khat le sang zawl hra hi phur awla ralkap pawl riahnak ah na ule pawl hei sum aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun a khal mi cawhnawi hlom hra in keng awla ralkap hotu ralbawipa va pek aw. Na ule pawl an dam le dam lo va zoh awla, an dam a si, ti theihnak ah an thil pakhatkhat run keng aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul siangpahrang le na ule pawl le Israel ralkap pawl cu Filistin ral an do ih Sasuapi Rawn ah an um a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah David cu a thaizing zingpitah a tho ih tuu pawl khaltu dingah mi pakhat a ai-awh ah a retta ih a pa Jesse ih a fial vekin ei ding rawl pawl kengin a feh. Israel ralkap pawl cu Filistin pawl do dingah au phah in raldonak hmunih an feh ciamco laifangah David cu ralkap riahnak ahcun a va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Filistin ralkap pawl le Israel ralkap pawl cu do-aw dingah ṭanṭhat an khuar veve ih hmaiton in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah David cu rawl lamih ṭuanvo latu ralbawi hnenah a rawl kenmi cu taanta in raldonak ah a va tlan ih a ule pawl cu an dam le dam lo a va zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ule pawl thawn an biak awk rero laiah Goliath cu hmaiah a rasuak ih a hlanih a ti ṭheu bangtuk in Israel ralkap pawl cu a zuam lala. Cumi cu David in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Goliath cu Israel ralkap pawl in an hmuh tikah an ṭih tuk ih an tlan ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pakhat le pakhat, “Zohhnik uh, khi pa lawmmam khi! A mi zuam daan cu ngaihnik uh! Khi pa a that theitu cu kan siangpahrang in milian ah a tuah rori ding; a fanu a ṭhitter ding ih a pa ih sungte pawl cu ngunkhuai a olh thluh ding a si ko,” tiah an ti-aw rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah David in a kiangkap ih a ummi pawl hnenah, “Hi Filistin pa a thattu le hi bangtuk ningzah phurhnak ihsin Israel mi a luattertu in ziangso a ngah ding. Thungai ih ti ahcun, a nungmi Pathian ih ralkap pawl zuamtu dingah cun hi Pathian awi lo Filistin pa cu ziangso a va si lem,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Goliath a thattu cu laksawng tampi a ngah ding tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutiih David le ralkap pawl an biak awk rero cu David ih u Eliab in a theih tikah a thin a heng ih, “Hinah ziangso na ra tuah? Ramlak ih na tuu pawl zoso a rak khal? Nang mi doksang pa! Raldo awk zoh dingah na ra a sihi!” tiah a kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David in, “Ziang sualnak so ka tuah? Thu tal mi ka sut thei lo ding maw?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun hmundang a hoi ih midang hnenah cuih thu cu a sut sal. Thu a suh mi hmuahhmuah in an thulehnak a bangrep thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi hrekkhat in David ih ṭong cu an thei ih Saul an va sim. Cule Saul in David cu a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah David in Saul hnenah, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, hi Filistin pa cu zohman in ṭih ding a si lo. Keimah in ka va do mai ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul in, “Asilo, ziangtinso na do thei ding? Nang cu nauhak na si ih anih cu a sansung hmuahhmuah ralkap a si zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Asinain David cun, “Maw siangpahrang, kei cu ka pa ih tuu ka khal ṭheu. Kiosa a si lole savom in ka tuu note a tlanpi tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />sahrang cu ka dawi ih ka nam ciamco ih tuu note cu ka hum suak ṭheu a si. Cun kiosa a si lole savom in i zon tikah, a bakhmul in ka kai ih ka vuak that ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kiosa le savom tampi ka that zo a si ih a cuih pawl ka thah vekin hi Pathian awi lo Filistin pa, a nungmi Pathian ih ralkap pawl a zuamtu cu ka that ve ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kiosa le savom pawl hnen ihsin i humtu Bawipa cun hi Filistin pa ih kutsung khal in i hum ko ding,” tiah a ti. Cutikah Saul in, “A ṭha ko; va feh awla Bawipa Pathian in lo umpi hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cule Saul in a ralthuam cu David ih hruk dingah a pek. David ih lu ah dar lukhuh a khumterih a ralthuam a hrukter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />David in a hrukmi ralthuam parah cun Saul ih ralnam a pai ih feh a tum. Asinain a hruk dah lomi an si ruangah a fehpi thei lo. Cutikah David in, “Hi vek thaw cun ka do thei lo ding. Ka hruk dahmi an si lo,” tiah Saul hnenah a ti. Curuangah a phuak sal thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A tuu khalhnak funghreu a keng ih tiva kapih lungto hlum fate panga a sar ih a vaidip ah a san. Cutiin a lungherhden thawn Goliath do dingah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Filistin mi Goliath cun David cu a rak naih. A raldonak phaw a phurtu pa cu a hmaiah a fehter. A rak naih vivo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ṭhate ih David a hmuh ngahnak hmun ihsin a zoh tikah, David cu mi piangzet tlangval note a si ko lo maw tiah a nautat ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutikah David cu, “Kha-ih funghreu kha ziangtinak ah so na ken? Uico ah maw i ruat?” tiah a auh ih amah ih khawzing hmin ko in David cu a cam ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />David cu a zuam ih, “Ra hnik aw, na sa cu vate le ramsa pawl ka eiter ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Nang cun nam le fei le thal keng in do i tum. Sikhalsehla kei cu na zuammi Israel pawl ih Pathian Ziangkimtithei Bawipa ih hmin in nangmah do dingah ka ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuihsun rori ah Bawipa ih thawngin nangmah cu ka kutsung ah na thleng ding, ka lo neh ding. Na lu ka lo tan ding. Filistin ralkap pawl ih sa cu vate le ramsa pawl ih ei dingah ka pe ding. Israel cun Pathian a nei a si, ti kha hi ram mi hmuahhmuah in an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pathian cun amah ih minung pawl run dingah nam le fei pawl a ṭulter lo a si, ti cu mi hmuahhmuah in an hmu ding a si. Bawipa cu ral nehtu a si ih nanmah khal hi nan zatein kan kutsung ah a lo thlenter ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cule Goliath in David cu a rak naih sinsin ih David cun amah do dingah Filistin pawl lamah cun zamrang in a va tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />David in a vaidip sung a vun pur ih lungto hlumte pakhat a vun lak hnuah a lungherhden in Goliath cu a sai. Goliath ih calpadar ah a ngah ih a luruh a kuai. Curuangah Goliath cu a bokkhup in a ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cutiin ralnam hmang lotein David in Goliath cu lungherhden le lungto in a neh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />David cu a tlan ih Goliath parah a va ding. Cun Goliath ih ralnam cu a kawm sung ihsin a zuk ih a hngawng a tan ih Goliath cu a thi. Filistin ralkap pawl cu an micak bik pa a thih an hmuh tikah an tlanhlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cule Israel le Judah ram ihsin a rami ralkap pawl cun hmakhatte-ah an dawi hai ih au phah in Gath le Ekron kotka tiang an dawi. Filistin ralkap pawl ih ruak cu Gath le Ekron tiang Shaaraim lamzin ah an ril teptep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Israel ralkap pawl cu an kir ih Filistin ralkap riahnak ih thilri pawl cu an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />David in Goliath ih lu cu a lak ih Jerusalem ah a phur. Asinain Goliath hriamnam pawl cu amah ih buuk sungah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Goliath do dingih David a feh kha Saul in a rak hmuh tikah a ralkap hotu ralbawipa Abner a ko ih, “Khi nauhak pa khi zoso a si?” tiah a sut. Abner in, “Maw siangpahrang bawipa, zoso a si ti ka thei lo,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />“Va feh awla zo ih fapa so a si, ti va hliah aw,” tiah Saul in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Cun a thah hnu ih an riaknak ih David a rathlen tikah, David cu Abner in Saul hnenah a fehpi. David in Goliath ih lu cu a keng thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Tlangvalpa, zoso na si?” tiah a sut. Cule David in, “Bethlehem khuami na salpa Jesse ih fapa ka si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul le David cu thu an rel tlang thluh hnu in Saul fapa Jonathan ih thinlung cu David hnenah a kop ih amah le amah a duh awk vek rori in David cu a duhdawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah cuih ni thokin Saul in David cu a inn ah tlunter siang loin a hnenah a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan in David cutluk ih a duh ruangah kumkhua ih rualpi ṭha si dingin thu a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hruk laimi angki fualpi a phuak ih David a pek. A ralthuam, a ralnam, a li le a taikhap pawl khal a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Saul in David cu raldo dingah a thlah ṭheu ih a thlah tin in ral pawl cu a va neh ṭheu. Curuangah Saul in David cu ralbawi pakhat ah a tuah ih ralbawi dang pawl le ralkap pawl cu an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Goliath a thah hnu ih Israel ralkap pawl an ra tlun tikah Israel ramsung khua pawl ihsin nunau hmuahhmuah an tho ih Saul siangpahrang hmuak dingah an feh. Lungawinak hla an sa ih khuang le dar le ṭingṭang tum phah in an laam ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungawi ih an laam phah ah nunau pawl in; “Saul cun a thawng a sawm in a that; David cun a thawng a za in a that,” tiah hla an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Saul cu a lung a kim lozet ih a thin a heng ngaingai. “David cu a thawng a za that ah an ruat ih kei cu a thawng a sawm lawng that ah in ruat. David hrangah cun siangpahrang ih hung can ding lawng a sam a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Saul cun a cuih ni ih thokin David cu a nahsiikta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thaisun ah Pathian ih thlahmi thlarau ṭha lo in Saul cu a kai ih a inn sungah miaa vekin a phun rero. Cule ni dangih a tuah ṭheu vekin David in ṭingṭang a tum ih Saul cun feipi a keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thinlungte in, “Phar sansiah ah ka khawh pei,” tiah a ruat. Cule voihnih a khawh ih a voihnih in David cu a rak pet man ih a khawh ngah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Saul cu a tlansan ih David hnenih a um kha a hmuh tikah Saul in David cu a ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah ralkap thawngkhat hotu ralbawi ah a tuah ih raldo dingah a thlah. Raldonak ah David in a ho hai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu a hnenih a um ruangah ral pawl cu a neh ih a thil timi hmuahhmuah ah a hlawhtling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David cu a thiltinak tinkim ah a hlawhtling ti kha Saul in a hmuh tikah Saul cun a ṭih sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Asinain Israel le Judah ram sung mi hmuahhmuah in David cu an duhzet, ziangahtile hotu ṭha ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Saul in David hnenah, “Ralṭha le rinsan tlak in ka hna na ṭuan ih Bawipa Pathian ih ral tla na do a si ahcun ka fanu upadeuh Merab na nupi ah ka lo pe ding,” tiah a ti. Saul ih ruahnak ahcun David cu amah ih thah ṭul loin Filistin pawl a donak ah an that leh pam ding, ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in, “Kei hi zoso ka si ih zo ih sungkhat ka si ruangah so siangpahrang ih maakpa ka si zik?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain David thawn an ṭhit awknak ding tikcu a thlen tikah Merab cu Meholah khuami Adrial an timi pa sawn a neihter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Saul ih fanu Mikhal cu David thawn an ngai-aw ih cu mi cu Saul in a theih tikah a lung a awizet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul cun, “Mikhal cu David ka neihter ding; ziangahtile Mikhal cu David hrangah thang a si pei ih Filistin pawl in David an that ding,” tiah a ruat. Curuangah Saul in David cu, “Ka maakpa na si ding,” a ti. Hiti ih a ti cu a voihnihnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“David cu a thupte in va tong uhla, ‘Siangpahrang bawipa cu na parah a lung a awi ngaingai a si ih, a kuthnuai bawi pawl khalin an lo duhzet a si. Siangpahrang fanu cu atuih na ṭhit le a ṭhabik ding,’ tiah va sim uh,” tiah Saul in a kuthnuai bawi pawl cu thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cumi cu David an sim ih cutikah David in, “Siangpahrang ih maakpa si ding cu sunloih ding ngaingai a si. Keimah vek mifarah le mi nauta hrangah cun ruah ban ding hman a si lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawi pawl in David ih ṭong cu Saul an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “David cu va sim uh; ‘Siangpahrang in a fanu man ah ziangdang duhmi a nei lo. A ral pawl phulaknak ah Filistin ralkap pawl ih zahmawh vunzim zakhat lawng a ngen a si,’ va ti uh,” tiah a kuthnuai bawi pawl hnenah thu a pek. David cu Filistin pawl in an that pei, tiah Saul ih tumtah mi cu a si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul ih ṭongkam cu a kuthnuai bawi pawl in David an va sim tikah David cu siangpahrang ih maakpa si ding kha a ruah tikah a hni suamso. Ṭhit awk ding ni a thlen hlanah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David le a ralkap pawl cun Filistin pawl an va do ih minung zahnih an that. David in Filistin ralkap pawl ih zahmawh vunzim cu Saul siangpahrang hnenah a fehpi ih a maakpa si duh ah a hmai rori ah a va siarsak. Cule Saul in a fanu Mikhal cu David a neihter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian cu David hnenah a um ti le a fanu Mikhal khal in David cu a duhzet ti kha Saul in fiangtein a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Curuangah David cu a ṭih sinsin ih a nunsung hmuahhmuah a ralah a cangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Filistin ralkap pawl in Israel mi pawl cu atu le atu an ra do ṭheu. Asinain David in ralbawi dang hmuahhmuah hnakin a neh thei deuh ringring ruangah David cu a hmin a thang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul in David thah tengteng a tumnak thu kha a fapa Jonathan le a kuthnuai bawi pawl a sim. Jonathan in David cu a duhzet ruangah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka pa in thah a lo tum a si. Thaizing cu ralring awla hmun thup pakhatkhatah rak relh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hramlak na umnak ih ka pa a rat tikah ka rak thlun ve ding ih na thuhla cu ka sim ding. Thu theihmi ka nei asile ka lo sim ding,” tiah David cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule a pa ih hnenah Jonathan in David ṭhatnak thu a sim ih, “Bawipa, David na salpa hi a siatnak tuah hlah aw. Anih in na parah zianghman siatnak a tuah dah lo ih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu na hrangih a ṭhahnem mi sawn an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Goliath a thah laiah khan a nunnak hman ruat loin a tuahmi a si ih Bawipa in Israel hrangah ral tumpi a neh a si. Cumi na hmuh tikah na lung a rak awizet. Cuti a si ruangah ziangah so mawhnak nei lomi David cu ziang thu hman um loin a thah na tum?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan ih thusimmi cu Saul in a ngai ih Bawipa in hmin sal in, “David cu thah a si lo pei” tiah thu a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah Jonathan in David cu a ko ih a pa ih ṭongmi hmuahhmuah cu a sim ṭheh. Cuih hnuah a pa ih hnenah a fehpi ih David cu a hlan bangtuk in siangpahrang ih hnaṭuantu ah a cang sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel le Filistin pawl ral an do-aw sal ih David in a nam hai ih nasa zetin a neh ruangah Filistin pawl cu a suk le a so ah an tlan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nikhat ah Bawipa ih thlah mi thlarau ṭha lo in Saul cu a kai lala ih a inn sungah Saul cu feipi kengin a to. David cu Saul hrangah ṭingṭang a tum rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Culaifang ah Saul in feipi cun a khawh ih David a rak pet man ruangah a feipi cu phar parah a phun-aw cukci. David cu a tlan ih a luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul in a cuih zanah David ih inn va thlingthla dingah le a thaizing ih David that dingah mihrek khat a thlah. Asinain a nupi Mikhal in, “Tuih zanih na tlan lo asile thaizing ahcun na thi rori ding,” tiah ralrinnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nupi cun sangkate ihsin a lengah a vun thlak ih David cu a tlanhlo ih a luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun an innsang milem a lak ih an ihkhun parah Mikhal cun a ret. Me hmul ih tuahmi lukham a lu lamah a ret ih puan in a khuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Saul ih milai pawl David kai dingih an rat tikah Mikhal in, “David a dam lo a si,” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Saul in, “Nan mit hrimhrim in va zoh uh. A ihkhun thawn hitawk ah rak zawn uhla ka that ding,” tiah a tiih a minung a thlah sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David inn sungih an vung luh tikah ihkhun parah innsang milem le a lu lamih mehmul in tuahmi lukham cu an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Ziangah so hiti in i bum ih ka ral na luatter?” tiah Mikhal cu a sut. Cule Mikhal in, “Ka luatnak ding i bawm aw. Culole ka lo that ding, i ti ruangah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David cu a tlan vivo ih Ramah khua ah Samuel hnenah a va thleng. Saul in a parih a tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu Samuel a sim thluh. Cuih hnuah David le Samuel cu Naioth ah an feh ih cutawkah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David cu Ramah khua kiang Naioth khua ah a um, tiah Saul an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah David kai dingah Saul in mi a hei thlah. Naioth khua an thlen tikah Samuel ih ho in profet pawl profet ṭong in an ṭong ih an phun an tlok ruri kha an hmu. Cutikah Saul ih milai pawl khal Pathian ih thlarau in a kai ih an phun an tlok ciamco ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih thu Saul in a theih tikah mi tam deuh a thlah. Asinain annih khal cuti thotho in an um ve. Voithum tiang mi a thlah ih cuti thotho cun an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih hnuah amah Saul siangpahrang rori a pok ih Ramah ahcun a feh. Seku an timi tikhur tumpi a va thleng ih, cutawkah Samuel le David umnak a suh tikah Ramah kiang Naioth khua ah an um, tiah mi in an rak sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lamzin ih a feh laiah Bawipa ih thlarau in Saul khal cu a kai ve ih profet ṭong in a ṭong ih phun phah le tlok phah in Naioth cu a va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel ih hmuhhngan ah a hnipuan a hlit ṭheh ih a phun a tlok ciamco. Cuticun a lawngfangkheh in sunvu le zanvar cutawkah a it. Curuangah, “Saul khal profet a si ve maw si?” ti ih ṭongṭhimnak ih a cantanak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David cu Ramah khua kiang Naioth khua ihsin a tlan ih Jonathan hnenah a thleng sal ih a hnenah, “Thil sual ziangso ka tuah? Ziang mawhnak so ka neih? Na pa ih parah ziangvek thilsia ka tuah ruangah so hiti ih thah i tum?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Jonathan in, “Pathian in na thih ding cu lo siang hram hlah seh. Ka pa in a tuahmi hmuahhmuah cu thupi siseh, thute siseh i sim thluh ṭheu. Thah a lo tum sisehla i pheh lo ding. I sim ko ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule David in, “Nangmah in kei hi ziangtluk i duh ti cu na pa in a theih ruangah a tumtahmi cu na thinlung natter ding a phan ruangah lo theihter a tum lo a si. Ka thihnak ah kar khat lawng a sam ti cu Bawipa ih hmin in ka kam ngam a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Tuahter i duhmi pohpoh ka tuah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Thaisun hi Thla Thar Puai a si ih siangpahrang hnenih rawl ei ding ka si. Asinain na lung a kim ve asile hramlakah ka feh pei ih tipsun zanlam tiang ka va thup-aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rawl ei tikcu ih ka um lo tikah na pa in i hlam asile Bethlehem an inn ah zamrangin a va tlungta; ziangahtile an sungkhat in kumtin an pek ṭheumi thawinak pek tikcu a si ih keimah i simta a si, tiah run ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah na pa in, ‘A ṭha ko,’ a ti ahcun phan ding zianghman a um lo. Asinain a thin a heng a si ahcun i siatsuah tengteng a tum ti na thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I zaangfah hram awla ka hnenih Pathian hmin sal in thukamnak na tuah mi cu thlun hram aw. Sikhalsehla keimah lehlam ka mawh a si ahcun nangmah sawn in i that aw. Ziangah so na pa ih kut cun ka thih ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Jonathan in, “Cuticun a si lo pei. Ka pa in thah a lo tum ngaingai a si, ti ka theihfiang a si ahcun ziangtinso nangmah sim loin ka um thiam ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule David in, “Na pa thinheng zetin a ṭong, ti cu zoso in sim sal ding?” tiah Jonathan cu a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jonathan in, “Hramlakah feh uhsi,” tiah a sawm. Curuangah hramlakah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah David hnenah Jonathan in, “Israel ih Bawipa Pathian cu in theihpitu si hram seh. Thaisun le tipsun atu tikcu ah hin ka pa cu thu ka rak sut ding. A thinlung na parih a ṭhat a si ahcun thu ka lo than ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain siatsuah a lo tum a si ahcun, ka lo theihter ding ih na rak tlan pei. Ka lo theihter lo ih siatsuahnak na tong a si ahcun Pathian in i that seh. Ka pa hnenih Bawipa a rak um bangin na hnenah um ve hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun ka nun hrih a si ahcun na thukamnak thianghlim cu hmunter awla ka hrangah rintlakmi si hram aw. Asinain ka thih ahcun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kumkhua in ka innsang pawl hnenah na zaangfahnak run langter hram aw. Cun Bawipa in na ral hmuahhmuah an ci a hmih thluh tik khalah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kan thukamnak cu ziangtik hmanah cat hlah seh. A cat asile Bawipa in nangmah a lo mawhthluk ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathan in David cu a duhdawtnak thu a kam sal, ziangahtile amah le amah a duh-awk vek rori in Jonathan in David cu a duhdawt a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Jonathan in, “Thaisun cu Thla Thar Puai a si ih na tel lo ahcun na tokham a lawng ding ih na um lo a langzet ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tel lo kha tipsun ahcun a lang sinsin ding. Curuangah kan dungih na thuh awknak hmunah khan va feh sal awla cutawkih lungkhon reprep phenah khan va relh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hmuibat bangin cutawk cu thal pathum in ka rak sai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule thal pawl hawl dingah ka hnen-um pa ka rak thlah ding. A hnenah, ‘Thal pawl cu na umnak ihsin hi lam kap ah an um; rak lak hai aw,’ ka ti a si ahcun na hrangah phan ding zianghman a um lo, na ra suak thei, tinak a si ding. Phan ding a um lo ti cu Bawipa ih hmin in ka sim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a hnenah, ‘Thal pawl cu na umnak ihsin khatlam kapah an um a si,’ ka ti ahcun rak tlan aw. Bawipa in hmun dangih feh dingah a lo duh, tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kan karlak ih thukamnak kan tuahmi thu ahcun kumkhua ih ka hmun ternak dingah Bawipa in a kimter ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah David cu hramlak ah a thup aw. Thla Thar Puai rawl ei-nak ah Saul siangpahrang cu a ra lut ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />a to ṭheunak phar kiangah a to. A sangtu ah Abner a to ih, Jonathan cu cabuai ih khatlam kap, Saul ih hmaizawn ah a to. David ih tokham cu a lawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asinain cuih ni ah Saul cun zianghman a sim lo, ziangahtile, “A thianhlim lonak thil pakhatkhat a um a si ding,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A thaisun, Thla Thar Puai hnu ni khatnak ah, David ih tokham cu a lawng thotho. Curuangah Saul in, “Ziangah so mizan sun siseh, tuihsun siseh rawl einak ih David a suah lo?” tiah Jonathan a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Jonathan in, “Bethlehem ih feh dingah thungai thlak in i dil ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Ka sungkhat pawl kan khua ah raithawinak puai an tuah ih ka u pa in tel tengteng dingah i rak cah a si; curuangah ka rual ṭha na si ahcun i thlah hram awla ka sungkhat pawl ka va tong hai ding,’ i ti. Curuangah hi rawl einak ih a tel thiam lonak a si,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih thu cu Saul in a theih tikah a thin a heng tuk ih, “Nang mihlotlau, raltho le rintlaklo nunau ih fapa! Jesse ih fapa David na ṭan a si tihi fiangten ka thei zo. Na nuih thang na siatter ih nangmah ih thang khal na siat-aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David a nunsung hmuahhmuah cu hi ramih siangpahrang na si dah lo ding, ti na thei lo maw? Atu zamrangin va feh awla David cu hitawk ah va hruai aw - a thih a ṭul a si!” tiah Jonathan cu a kawk ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah Jonathan in, “Ziangah so a thih ding? Ziang so a sual?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in Jonathan sunthat dingin a feipi a vun lak ih a khawh. Cuih hnu cun a pa in David thah tengteng a tum a si, ti cu Jonathan in feltein a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cabuai ihsin Jonathan cu thinheng zetin a tho ih cuih ni Thla Thar Puai a ni hnihnak ni cu zianghman ei loin a um. A pa Saul in David cu mualpho tukih a tuah ruangah Jonathan cun a ninghanpi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An tiam awk cia bangtuk in a thaizing ah Jonathan cu David tong dingah hramlakah a feh. Jonathan cun tlangval note pakhat a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A cuih tlangval pa ih hnenah, “Ka sai ding mi thal pawl hi va tlan awla va hawl aw,” tiah a ti. Tlangvalpa cu a tlan ih Jonathan in thal cu hlatpi ah a sai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thal a tlaknak zawn a va thlen tikah Jonathan cu na pi in a au ih, “Thal cu hlatpi ah a um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khatawkah ding men hlah. Zamrang in feh aw,” tiah a ti. Tlangvalpa cun thal cu a sar ih a bawipa ih hnenah a thlenpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Asinain a tican zianghman a thei lo. Jonathan le David hrangah cun tican a nei thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cule li le thal pawl cu khawsungih hei fehpi dingah Jonathan in a tlangvalpa cu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tlangvalpa a feh hnuah a relhnak lungkhon phen ihsin David cu a tho ih leilung dai rori in voithum tiang a lu a kun. David le Jonathan cu an hnam-aw ih an ṭap veve. David ih riahsiatnak cu Jonathan ih riahsiatnak hnakin a zual sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule Jonathan in, “Na hnenah Pathian um hram seh. Bawipa in kan pahnih karlak le na tesinfa le ka tesinfa karlak ih Bawipa ih hmin sal in thukamnak kan tuah mi cu kan hngetkhohter ringringnak dingah in bawm hram seh,” tiah David hnenah a ti. Cule David cu a feh ih Jonathan cu khawsungah a kir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David cu Nob khua puithiam Ahimelek hnenah a feh ih Ahimelek cun thinphang zetin a rak hmuak; “Ziangah so nangmah lawng na rat? Zotal ih an lo thlun lo?” a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Siangpahrang in hnaṭuan i fial ruangah ka ra a si. Cuih i fialmi thu cu zohman sim lo dingah i tiam fawn. Ka ralkap pawl cu hmunkhat khatih i tong dingin ka tiam hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun ei ding ziangso na neih? Sang zawl nga a si lole na neihmi pohpoh i pe aw,” tiah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule puithiam cun, “Sang menmen pawl ka nei lo. Ka neih mi cu sang thianghlim a si. Na ralkap pawl in tunai hrawngah nunau an pawl lo a si ahcun nan ei thei ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Nunau an pawl hrimhrim lo. Nunau hrimhrim kan hnenah an um lo. Thupi um lem lo ih khual kan tlawn hmanah ka ralkap pawl cu, an thuamhnaw pawl thawn, thianghlim zetin an um ringring. Atu cu a hleice ih thupi mi hnaṭuan kan neih ruangah a hleice in an thianghlim a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah puithiam Ahimelek in David cu sang thianghlim a pek, ziangahtile a neihmi sang cu Pathian hrangih hunmi sang lawng a si ih cabuai thianghlim ihsin an lak zomi, a ai ah sang thar tla an ret sal zomi, sang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Edom mi Doeg cu Pathian biak ah cutawk ahcun a rak um ve ngelcel. Doeg cu Saul siangpahrang ih tuukhaltu pawl hotu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David in Ahimelek hnenah, “Keimah pek dingah fei a si lole nam tal na nei maw? Siangpahrang in zamrangih i fial ruangah ralnam zianghman ka la man lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Ahimelek in, “Elah Rawn ih na thah mi Filistin mi Goliath ih ralnam cu ka nei. Puithiam ṭaangthlaih angki ih phenah puan in kan tuam ih a um ko. Hinah cumi lawng hriamnam a um. Na duh asile la aw,” tiah a ti. David in, “I pe aw. Khuihman ah hi bangtuk ralnam a um lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun David cu a feh sal. Saul ih hmuh thei lonak ah a feh ih Gath ram siangpahrang Akhish hnenah a va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gath ramih bawi pawl cun an siangpahrang Akhish hnenah, “Hi pa hi amah ramih siangpahrang a si vemi David a si lo maw? ‘Saul in a thawng a sawm in a that ih David cun a thawng a za in a that,’ tiah nunau pawl an laam phah ih hla ih an phuah mi pa kha amah hi a si,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ṭong cu David in a thei thluh ih curuangah Gath siangpahrang Akhish cu David in a ṭih ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah an zate ih hmuh ah a aa awter. An hmaiah cun a umdaan a lamdang awter ih an khua ih kotka par tla ah thuphan pipi a ngan ih, a cil tla cu a khahmul parah a luang thluahthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Akhish in a kuthnuai bawi pawl hnenah, “Hi pa hi a aa a sisi. Ziangah so ka hnenah nan ratpi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miaa ka hlawhsam ah maw si nan ruat? Ka inn sung hnaihnoktu dingah ziangah so hi miaa pa hi nan rak hruai?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gath khua ihsin David a tlan sal ih Adullam khua kiangih a um mi lungkua ah a thleng. Cutawkah a um ti kha a unau pawl le a sungkhat pawl in an theih tikah a hnenah an va feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hremnak a tuarmi le leiba a neimi le lungkim lonak a neimi hmuahhmuah tla cu a hnenah an va feh ih anmah pawl hotu ah a cang. An zatein minung zali hrawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun David cu Moab ram, Mizpah khua ah a va feh ih Moab siangpahrang hnenah, “Pathian in ka hrangih a tumtahnak fiangteih ka theih hlan lo cu na hnenah hin ka nu le ka pa ra um thei hram hai sehla tiah zaangfah ka lo dil,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah David in a nu le a pa cu Moab siangpahrang hnenah a taan ih lungkua ih a relh sung hmuahhmuah Moab siangpahrang hnenah cun an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule profet Gad cu David hnenah a ra ih, “Hitawk hmunah um nawn hlah. Zamrang in Judah ramah feh aw,” tiah a ra ti. Curuangah David cu Hereth tupi sungah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul cu Gibeah khua ah a um ih ni khat cu a feipi kengin tlang parih tuumkung hnuai ah a to. A kuthnuai ih bawi pawl in an kil ṭhepṭhep. Cule David le a milai pawl umnak kan thei, tiah Saul cu an ra sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in a kuthnuai bawi pawl hnenah, “Benjamin mi pawl, i ngai uh! David in lo le sabit hmuan in pe ding ih a ralkap sungah thawngkhat hotu le zakhat hotu ralbawi ah in tuah thluh ding, tiah nan ruat maw si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A cuih ruangah maw siatsuah dingah in phiar ciamco? Ka fapa rori David hnenih a ṭan ih thukamnak a tuah tla zohman in in sim lo. Zohman in in ninghanpi hrimhrim lo. Ka sungsuak ka fapa rori in a forh ruangah ka minung a si mi David in atu-ah keimah thah theinak tikcu lawnglawng a hawl ti tla zohman in in sim dah lo,” tiah a hrang ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul ih kuthnuai bawi pawl hnenah Edom mi Doeg a rak ding ve ih anih in, “Nob khua ih a ummi Ahitub ih fapa Ahimelek hnenih David a feh ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David hrangah Ahimelek in Bawipa ih hnenah thla a cam ih rawl tla a pek ih Filistin mi Goliath ih ralnam khal a pek a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Saul siangpahrang in puithiam Ahimelek le Nob khua ih puithiam a ṭuan ve mi a sungkhat pawl hmuahhmuah cu a ko ih a hnenah cun an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Saul cun, “Ahitub ih fapa Ahimelek ka thusimmi hi ngaihnik!” tiah a ti. Ahimelek in, “Ka lo ngai a si, bawipa,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Saul in, “Ziangah so David le nangmah in kei hi in phiar rero? Ziangah so David cu rawl le ralnam na pek ih Pathian hnenih thla na cam sak? Atu-ah David cu keimah i ral ih tikcu ṭha lawng a bawh a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Ahimelek in, “Na kuthnuai ih bawi hmuahhmuah lakah David bangtuk rintlak zoso a um? Na maakpa rori a si, nangmah a lo kilvengtu ralkap pawl ih bawi a si; cun na kuthnuai mi hmuahhmuah in an upat thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hrangih thla ka cam cu atu hi a hmaisa bik a si lemlo. Asinain nangmah siatsuah dingih phiar thu ahcun keimah siseh, ka sungkhat siseh in puh hrimhrim hlah. Hi thu cu samphang tia hman ka theih mi a um lo,” tiah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah siangpahrang in, “Ahimelek, nangmah le na sungkhat pawl cu ka lo that ṭheh ding,” a ti ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a kiangih a dingmi ralkap pawl hnenah, “ Bawipa ih puithiam pawl hi that ṭheh uh. David thawn in phiar ih David a tlan zo ti khal an thei ringring naón in sim duh lo a si,” tiah thu a pek. Asinain Pathian ih puithiam pawl thah ding cu an duh loih ralkap pawl cu an kut hman an hawi duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in Doeg cu, “Nangmah in puithiam pawl hi that ṭheh aw,” tiah a fial ih, a fial vekin Doeg cun a that ṭheh. Cuih ni ah Bawipa Pathian ih puithiam pawl sawmriat le panga a that a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih tlunah puithiam khua an ti ṭheu mi Nob khawsungih a um mi minung hmuahhmuah khal thatthluh dingin Saul in thu a pek ruangah mipa siseh, nunau siseh, nauhak siseh, naute suakpek siseh, caw, laak le tuu pawl tiangin an that thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain Ahimelek ih fapa pawl sungah Abiathar an timi pa cu a luat ih David hnenah a tlan suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian ih puithiam pawl cu Saul in a that thluh a si, tiah David cu a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Nikhat ih Doeg ka hmuh tikah khan Saul a va sim tengteng ding, tiah ka zum tho a si. Curuangah Abiathar, na sungkhat pawl an thih thluh cu keimah ih ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hnenah hin um awla na thinphang hlah aw. Nangmah le keimah thah ding cu Saul ih duhbikmi a si. Asinain ka hnenah cun na him ko ding,” tiah Abiathar cu a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin pawl in Keilah khua an siim ih an khawm tharmi thlai rawl tla an ru ciamco, tikha David in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa Pathian hnenah, “Filistin pawl ka va do pei maw?” tiah a sut. Cutikah, “Do awla Keilah khua cu runsuak aw,” tiah Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla a milai pawl in David hnenah, “Judah ram sungah phan ding tampi kan nei sikhawh, Keilah khua ah feh tahratin Filistin pawl kan do asile kan harsa sinsin ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah David in Bawipa cu a ron sal ih Bawipa in, “Keilah ah Filistin pawl cu va do aw; ziangahtile na neh hai ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah David le a ralkap pawl cu Keilah ah an feh ih Filistin pawl an do. Filistin pawl cu tampi an thi ih an ṭilva pawl tla tampi an long. Cuticun Keilah khua cu David in a runsuak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahimelek ih fapa Abiathar cu a tlan ih David hnenih a thlen tikah puithiam kor ṭaangthlaih a keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Keilah khua ah David a thleng tikha Saul an sim tikah Saul cun, “Tlakrawh ih kulhmi, kotkalh le hauhruang ih kulhmi khua ah David a thleng zo ih amah le amah a kharhkhum-aw zo. Bawipa in ka kut sungah a ret zo a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in Keilah khua do dingah le David le a ralkap pawl kai dingah a ralkap pawl cu a ko thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul in i do tum a si, tikha David in a theih tikah, “Puithiam kor ṭaangthlaih cu rak keng aw,” tiah puithiam Abiathar cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule David in, “Maw Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, na salpa keimah ruangah hin Saul cu Keilah ah a ra ding ih a siatsuah thluh ding, tiah ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keilah khawsungmi pawl hin Saul ih kutah in pe pei maw? Ka theih vekin Saul cu a ra ngaingai pei maw? Maw Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian, ka lo suhmi hi i let hramhram aw,” tiah a dil. “Saul cu a ra tengteng ding,” tiah Bawipa in a run let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Keilah khawsungmi pawl hin Saul ih kutah keimah le ka milai pawl hi in pe ding maw?” tiah a sut. “An lo pe ding” tiah Bawipa in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah David le a ralkap zaruk tluk cu Keilah khua ihsin zamrangin an suak ih an tlan. David a tlan zo ti kha Saul in a theih tikah a tumtahmi cu a ṭul sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David cu a relh ih Zif khua kiang hramlak ah a um. Saul in a sun a zan in David cu a hawl naón Saul kutsungih thlen ding cu Pathian in a siang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Saul in a thah lawnglawng a tum ruangah David cu a thin a phang thotho. Zif khua kiang thlaler ramṭhing ih Horesh an timi hmunih David a um laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jonathan cu a hnenah a va feh ih Bawipa ih hmin in thinnau lo dingah tha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David hnenah cun, “Na thinphang hlah. Ka pa Saul in a lo that thei hrimhrim lo ding. Israel siangpahrang na si leh ko ding ih keimah khal nangmah sangtu ka si ko ding. Cumi cu ka pa in a thei thluh ko,” tiah Jonathan in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun rualpi ṭha an sinak cu Pathian hmaiah thu an kam-aw sal. David cu Horesh ah a um ih Jonathan cu inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zif khuami hrekkhat cu Gibeah khua ah Saul hnenah an va feh ih, “David cu kan ram sungah a um ih Judea ramṭhing thlanglam kap, Hakhilah tlang, Horesh timi hmunah a relh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Maw siangpahrang bawipa, David kaihsuak ding cu ziangtlukin so na duh ti khal kan thei thluh ko. Curuangah kan ramah ra awla na kaihsuak theinak dingin kan ngaihtuah ding,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Hi tlukih ka zawn in ruah ruangah Pathian in lo thluasuah hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Va feh uhla khuitawk fangah so a um ih zo in so a hmu ti tla va hliah ṭha uh. David cu mi depdezet a si tiah ka thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah a relhnak hmun rori va hawlsuak uhla pelh loin ka hnenah i ra sim sal uh. Cule nan hnenah ka feh pei ih Judah ram pumpi ka hawl a ṭul khalle cuih ram hrawngih a um hrih a si ahcun ka hawlsuak rori ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Curuangah an pok ih Saul thlen hlanah Zif khua ah an kir. David le a milai pawl cu Judea hramlak thlanglam kap ramṭhing ah Maon an timi hramlak ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Saul le a ralkap pawl cu David hawl dingah an pok. Cuih thu cu David in a rak theih tikah Maon hramlak sungih lungto hlir in a khatmi horkuam ah a feh ih cutawkah a um. A cuih thu cu Saul in a theih ve tikah David cu a hei dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungto horkuam ih khatlam tlang ah Saul le a ralkap pawl cu an va thleng ih David le a milai pawl cu a khatlam tlang ah an um. David le a milai pawl cu kaih ding phangin an tlan ih Saul le a ralkap pawl in an dawi vivo ih an kai zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A culaifang ah mi pakhat Saul hnenah a ra ih, “Zamrang in rakir aw. Filistin mi pawl in kan ram in do a si,” tiah a ra sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in David cu dawi nawn loin Filistin pawl do dingah a kir. Curuangah a cuih hmun cu Sela Hammah-lekoth tiah an tita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />David cu cutawkin a feh ih En-gedi an timi hmunah lungkua-ah a relh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin a donak ihsin Saul a rakir tikah David cu En-gedi kiang ramcaar lakah a relh a si, tiah an rak sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in Israel ram ralkap lakih a ṭhabik mi thawngthum thawn David le a milai pawl cu Zaathar Khaam an timi hmun ihsin nisuahnak lamah an va hawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutawk lamzin kiangah tuu hruang an um ih a cuih kiangah cun lungpuk pakhat a um. A cuih lungpuk sung deng bikah David le a milai pawl cu an rak thup aw. Saul cu cutawk lungpuk a thlen tikah pawngthawh dingin lungpuk sungah a vung lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah David cu a milai pawl in, “Tikcu remcaangzet na ngah a si. Na ral cu na kut sungah ka lo pe ding, tiah Bawipa in a lo ti bangtuk in a lo pe ngaingai a si ih a parah na duh vekin na tuah thei,” tiah an ti. Cule David cu a thupte in a vak ih Saul ih theih loin a kor fualpi ih zimte a tansak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain Saul puanzim cutiih a tansak ruangah David cu a thin a nuam lo zet ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a milai pawl hnenah, “Pathian in siangpahrang ih a hrilmi ka bawipa cu ka tuahmawh lonak dingah Bawipa Pathian in i kil hram seh. Pathian ih hrilmi siangpahrang a si ruangah amah cu ka siatsuah hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule David in a milai pawl cu Saul that lo dingin a sim. Saul cu a tho ih lungpuk sung ihsin a suak ih a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule David cun a hei thlun ih, “Maw siangpahrang,” tiah a hei ko. Saul cu a dunglet a ra hoi ih cutikah David cu upatnak thawn leilung ah a bok ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Bawipa, David in a lo that tum a si, tiah a lo simtu pawl ih thu cu ziangah so na zum?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuih sunah lungpuk sungah nangmah cu Bawipa Pathian in ka kut sungah a lo thlenter ti cu na mit rori in na hmu ko a si. Mi hrekkhat pawl cun nangmah that dingah in forh, asinain ka lo zaangfah ih Pathian ih hrilmi siangpahrang na si ruangah malte hman ka tuahmawh lo ding, tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zohhnik, ka bawipa, na korfual zimte ka kenmi hi! Keimah rori ih ka tanmi a si. Asinain ka lo that lo. Himi na hmuh tikah hin nangmah do dingah le siatsuah dingah tummi ka nei lo, ti hi theifiang ding na si. Nang cun that dingah i hawl rero naón kei cun zianghman ka lo ti dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zo sawn kan mawh ti cu Bawipa Pathian in run rel hram seh. Nangmah cu malte hman ka lo tuahmawh lo ih nang cun i ral ruangah Pathian in lo cawh hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />‘Thil ṭha lo cu mi ṭha lo pawl in an tuah,’ ti ih ṭongṭhimnak cu na thei ko. Sikhalsehla kei cun ka lo tuahmawh hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Israel siangpahrang ih thah a tum rero mi hi zohhnik! A dawi vivo mi hi zohhnik! Uico ruak tluk fang a si. Uihli tluk fang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zo sawn kan mawh ti kha Bawipa Pathian in in zoh ding ih in relsak ding. Hi thuhla cu Bawipa in in tawlrel sak seh; i ṭan sehla i run hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutiih David in thu a sim ṭheh tikah Saul in, “Ka fapa David na si ngaingai maw?” a ti ih a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Saul in David hnenah, “Nangmah na dik ih keimah ka sual a si. Ka parah na ṭhazet naón kei cu na parah ka sia ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian in na kut sungah i ret naón i thah lo ruangah ka parah ziangtlukinso miṭha na si ti cu tuihsun ah na langter zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zo inso a ral khi a kaih hnuah himte in a thlah sal dah? Ka parih tuihsun ih na tuahmi ruangah hin Pathian in lo thluasuah hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang na si ding ih Israel ram na uknak cu a cat lo ding, ti cu atu ihsin fiangtein ka thei zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka hmin le ka innsang hmin cu hlo lo dingah, ‘Na tesinfa pawl cu ka zuah hai ding,’ tiah Bawipa ih hmin in thu i kam aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ti bangin David cun thu a kam. Cun Saul cu a inn ah a tlung ih David le a milai pawl cu an relhnak hmunah an kir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel cu a thi ih Israel mi hmuahhmuah an ra ih an ṭah. Cun Ramah khua ih a innah an phum. Cuih hnuah David cu Paran ram thlaler ramcaar ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Maon khua ah Kaleb miphun Nabal an ti mi pa a um ih Karmel khua ah leiram tla a nei. Milian zet a si ih tuu thawngthum le me thawngkhat a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nupi ih hmin cu Abigail a si. Abigail cu a mawizet ih a fimzet fawn; a sinan a pasal Nabal cu mi thinlung ṭha lo le hawizawng lo a si. Voikhat ah Nabal cu Karmel khua ah a tuu pawl ih hmul a met.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramṭhing ih a umnak ihsin a cuih thu cu David in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Curuangah a milai pahra tla cu Karmel khua feh dingah le Nabal tong dingah a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hitiin thu a cah, “Nangmah le na innsang le na neihmi hmuahhmuah parah thluasuah vanluhnak um ko seh, tiah David in thlaza a lo cam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Karmel khua ah na tuu pawl ih hmul na met, tihi David in a thei. Cun na tuukhal pawl cu kanmah hnenah an um ringring ih pakhat hman kan tuahmawh dah lonak thu tla hi na theih dingah a duhzet. Karmel khua ih an um sung hmuahhmuah ah an thil neihmi zianghman a hlo dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anmah tla hi sut awla an lo simfiang ko ding. Cun Karmel khua ah puai ni ah kan ra ding ih David in a milai pawl ṭhate-ih na rak zohṭhat dingah a lo dil a si. Curuangah na rual ṭha David hrangah le na sal pawl kanmah hrangah na pek thei zatzat in pe hram aw, nan ti pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David ih thucahmi cu Nabal hnenah David ih milai pawl cun an va sim. Cule an hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Nabal in, “David cu zoso a si? Jesse fapa cu zoso a si? Ka theih dahmi a si ual lo. Tuihsan cu kan ramah hin a tlanhlomi sal an tampi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sang le ka tidai le ka tuuhmul mettu pawl hrangih ka thahmi ṭilva sa pawl cu khuitawkin so an rat ti hman ka theih lomi hnenah cun ziangah so ka pek ding?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David ih milai pawl cu zamrangin an kir ih David hnenah Nabal ih ṭongmi cu an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Nan zatein nan ralnam pai ṭheh uh,” a ti ih an pai ṭheh. Amah David khal in a ralnam a pai ih a milai zali thawn an feh. A milai zahnih in an thilri an run kil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nabal ih hnen-um pakhat pa in Nabal ih nupi Abigail hnenah, “Na thei zo maw? David in hramlak a umnak ihsin kan bawipa hnenah mi a rak thlah ih thil malte ṭhen dingah zaangfah an ra dil. Asinain kan bawipa in a rak kawk ciammam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ngaingai ti ahcun, annih cu kan parah an ṭhazet a si. Ziangtik hmanah in hmuhsuam dah lo. Hramlak an hnenih kan um sung hmuahhmuah ah kan thil zianghman a hlo dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anmah thawn kan um sungah kan tuu pawl tla cu ṭhatein an kilkhawi ih a sun a zan in kanmah tla in hum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah hih thu hi ziangti tuah ding a si ti ruat ṭha aw. Kan bawipa le a innsang hrangah a poimawhzet theimi thu a si. Amah kan bawipa cu mi thinlung ṭha lozet a si ih zo ih thu hman a ngai duh fawn lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuvete in Abigail in sang zawl zahnih le sabit savun thawl hnih, a pum ih kio mi tuu panga, vaikan bawm hnih, caar ciami sabit rah bawr zakhat le caar ciami theirah hlom zahnih pawl cu zamrangte in a khawm ih laak pawl a phurhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule a hnen-um pawl hnenah, “Hmaiah rak feh uhla ka lo thlun ding,” tiah a ti. Asinain a pasal hnenah cun zianghman a sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Abigail cu a laak parah a to ih tlangmual ih lamzin a kelnak zawn a thlen fangah rin lopi in David le a ralkap pawl amah lamih a ra mi thawn an tong aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A culaifang ah David cun a thinlungte in, “Ziangah so hi hramlak ahhin Nabal ih neihmi pawl cu ka rak kil sak ngelcel? A thil pakhat hman a hlo dah lo, asinain hitluk ih ka bomnak parih i lehrulh daan cu a mawi lozet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thaizing ah an sungkurun in pakhat hman taang loin ka thah thluh lo asile Pathian in keimah i that sawn seh,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David a hmuh vete in Abigail cu a laak parih sin a ṭum ih leilung ah David ih kehram ah a bok ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Bawipa ka ṭong i ngai hram aw. Mawhthluknak cu keimah in ka tuar ko pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zianghman ih ṭhahnem lo pa Nabal ih thu cu zianghman ah siar hram hlah aw. Anih cu a hmin Nabal a si vek cekci in hawizawng lo a si. Bawipa, mi na rak thlahmi pawl cu kei cun ka rak tong hai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na ral pawl ih parah phulaknak zianghman tuah lo le na ral pawl that loih na um thei ṭheunak cu Bawipa Pathian in a lo kilkhawi ruangah a si. Cun na ral pawl le nangmah siatsuah a lo duhtu pawl cu Nabal bangin hrem an si ding, tiah a nungmi Bawipa ih hmin in atu-ah ka kam-aw ngam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Curuangah bawipa, ka rak lo kenmi laksawng hi zaangfahte in i sang hram awla na milai pawl tla pe hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tisualmi a um pang khalle i ngaithiam hram aw. Na nun sung hmuahhmuah ah thilṭha lo cu na tuah lo ding ih, Bawipa ih ral pawl tla na do vivo ruangah, Pathian amah in siangpahrang ah a lo tuah ding ih na tesinfa pawl khal siangpahrang ah a tuah hai ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi pakhatkhat in an lo do ih a thah an lo tum khalle milai in an sumsaw an kil ṭheu vekin Bawipa na Pathian in himte in a lo kilkhawi ding. Sikhalsehla mi pakhat in saihlum cu hlo ko ih a sai ṭheu vekin na ral pawl cu Bawipa Pathian in a lo hlonsak ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun a lo kam cia bangtuk in Bawipa Pathian in na parih a ṭha mi thil hmuahhmuah kimteih a thlenter tikah le Israel siangpahrang ih a lo tuah tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />thuhla zianghman um loih mi thah le phulak ruangah riahsiat ding le sir awk ding cu, maw bawipa, zianghman na nei lo ding. Cuti ih Bawipa Pathian in a lo thluasuah tikah, bawipa, kei hi i hngilh hram hlah aw,” tiah Abigail in a rak tlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Keimah tong dingih tuihsun ah a lo thlahtu Israel ih Pathian Bawipa cu thangṭhat si ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Laithahnak le phulaknak ihsin i luattertu dingih tuihsun ih thil na tuahmi le thinlung na neihmi ruangah Pathian cu ka lawm ih ka thangṭhat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nangmah tuahmawh loih i kilvengtu cu Bawipa a si. Zamrang in i ra tong hlah cila thaizing ahcun Nabal le a sungte pawl cu nan ci lo hmit thluh dingin a nungmi Bawipa , Israel ih Pathian hmin in thu ka rak kam-aw a si,” tiah Abigail cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cule Abigail ih rak kenmi thil pawl cu David in a sang ih, “Na inn ah va tlung awla va helhkam nawn hlah. I dilmi cu ka tuah thluh ding a si,” tiah Abigail cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Abigail cu inn ah a tlung. A pasal Nabal cu a inn ah siangpahrang ei ding tlak ih a thawmi rawl mankhung khung suangin rawl donak puai a rak tuah laifang a si. A pasal cu zu a ri ih nuam zetin a um laifang a si ruangah Abigail in a thaizing tiang ziangthu hman a sim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule a fimharh hnuah thuhla cu kimten a ruah. Cumi a theih vete in Nabal cu a thin a thir dukdi ih a lungphu a cawl ih a zengta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nihra hnuah Bawipa in a run bet ih Nabal cu a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nabal a thih cu David in a theih tikah, “Pathian cu thangṭhat si ko seh. Nabal in i hmuhsuam ruangah a parah Bawipa in phu a lak ih kei a salpa hi thil ṭha lo tuahnak ihsin i luatter. Nabal cu miṭha lo a si ruangah Bawipa in a cawh zo a si,” tiah a ti. Cule Abigail va bia dingah David in mi a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A hnen-um pawl cu Karmel ah Abigail hnenah cun an va feh ih, “David in a nupi dingih hruai dingah na hnenah in thlah a si,” tiah an va ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Abigail cu a lu a kun ih, “Keimah cu a salnu ka si ko ih a sal pawl ih ke kholhtu ding lawng ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cule a tho lohli ih a laak parah a to. A hnen-um nunau panga in an thlun ih David ih hnen-um pawl thawn an feh. Cule Abigail cu David ih nupi ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Jezreel khuami Ahinoam cu David in a rak ṭhi zo ih cuticun an pahnih in a nupi ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cule David ih a ṭhitmi Saul ih fanu Mikhal cu a pa Saul in pasal dang a neihter. A pasal ih hmin cu Gallim khua mi Laish ih fapa Palti a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gibeah khua Saul hnenah Zif khuami hrekkhat an ra ih Judea ramṭhing kiangih tlang pakhat Hakhilah tlang ah David cu a relh a si, tiah an ra sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmakhatte-ah Saul cu Israel ralkap lakih a ṭhabik ralkap thawngthum thawn Zif ih ramlak ahcun David hawl dingin an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hakhilah tlang kainak lamzin ah Saul cu a riak. Cuih hramlak ahcun David cu a rak um lai ih amah hawl ah Saul a ra ti a theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David cun thlingthlatu a thlah ih Saul cu a um ngaingai ti a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah David cu a feh ih Saul le Saul ralkap pawl uktu Ner ih fapa Abner ih ihnak hmun rori kha feltein a zohhliah. Saul cu an riahnak laifang bikah a it ih a ralkap pawl cu a kimvel ah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule David in, “Keimah thawn Saul riahnak ah zoso a feh ding?” tiah Hit mi Ahimelek le Joab ih unau Zeruiah ih fapa Abishai cu a sut. “Keimah ka feh ding,” tiah Abishai in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A cuih zanah David le Abishai cu Saul ih riahnak ah an feh ih an riahnak laifangih Saul a ih kha an hmu. A lu kiangah a feipi tla leilung ih a phun-awk kha an hmu. Saul ih kiangkap ahcun Abner le a ralkap pawl tla an it that thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Abishai in, “Tuihzan ah Pathian in na ral cu na kut sungah a lo pek. Amah ih feipi lala hin tlang koin ka vun sun pei. Voikhat sun a tawk ko ding, voihnih a ṭul hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah David cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain David in, “Tuahmawh hrimhrim hlah aw. Bawipa ih hriak a culh ciami siangpahrang a tuahmawhtu pohpoh cu hremnak tuar loin an luat lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah ih thih caan kimih thi dingin, a si lo talle raldonak ih thi dingin Bawipa in Saul cu a nunnak a cemter ko ding, ti cu a nungmi Bawipa ih hmin sal in ka sim ngam a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in siangpahrang ih a canter mi tuahmawh ding cu Bawipa Pathian in i siang hram hlah seh. A feipi le a tithawl lak uhsila feh uhsi,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule David cun Saul lukiang rori ih a ummi feipi le tithawl cu a lak ih Abishai thawn an feh. Zohman in an hmu loih an thei fawn lo. A ṭhanghoi khal an um lo. Ziangahtile Bawipa in an zatein ihhmuh thawzetin a ihthatter hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun David cu hlat nawn a feh ih khatlam ral tlangpar a thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Maw Abner! I thei thei maw?” tiah Abner le Saul ih ralkap pawl cu a auh ciamco. “Cutiih siangpahrang a auh ciamcotu cu zoso a si?” tiah Abner in a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Pacang na si, a si lo maw? Israel mi lakah mi nasa bik na si lo maw? Asinain ziangah so siangpahrang na bawipa cu ṭhatein na kil lo? Na bawipa that dingah tupekte ah nan riahnak sungah mi an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abner, na ṭuanvo na ṭhelh a si! A nungmi Bawipa ih hmin salin ka lo sim: thitlak na si; nan zatein thih tlak nan si. Ziangahtile Bawipa Pathian in siangpahrang ih a cantermi nan bawipa cu ṭhatein nan kil lo. Zohhnik! Khuiah so siangpahrang ih feipi a um? A lu kiangih tithawl teh khuiah so a si?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David ih aw cu Saul cun a theithiam ih, “David ka fapa, nangmah maw na si?” a ti. Cutikah David in, “Maw siangpahrang, keimah sokhaw ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa, ziangah so kei na salpa hi i dawi lai rero? Ziang bangtuk sualnak ka tuah ruangah so hiti ih in hual rero?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw bawipa, ka thusim mi hi rak ngaihnik aw. Hitiih i ral hi Bawipa Pathian ih a lo fial ruangah a si ahcun thawinak pe sehla a lung a ṭhum men ding. Asinain minung forhfialnak ruangah a si ahcun Bawipa ih siatserhnak an parah thleng hram seh. Ziangahtile ramdang khawzing tiang be dingah in dawihlo ih Bawipa in a miphun hnenih a pekmi ram sungih kei ka covo hmuahhmuah cu ka sung thluh zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian a um lonak, miphun dang pawl ih ram sungah ka thisen luangter hram hlah. Uihli tluk fang a si mi kei hi nang Israel siangpahrang in ziangah so thah i tum rero? Hramlak vate an peel bangin ziangah so i peel rero?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Ka sual zo a si. David ka fapa, rakir sal aw. Tuihsun ih ka nunnak i zuah ruangah nangmah siatsuah ding cu ka tum nawn hrimhrim lo ding. Ka aa tuk lawmmam! Thil ka ti sual zo a si,” tiah David hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule David in, “Maw siangpahrang, na feipi cu hinah a um. Na milai pakhatkhat rak thlah awla ra la seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Midik le rinsan tlak minung cu Bawipa in an ṭhat man a pek a si. Nangmah cu tuihsun ah Bawipa in ka kut sungah a lo ret a si. Sikhalsehla Bawipa ih hriak culhmi na si ruangah zianghman ka lo ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na nunnak ka sunloih ih tuihsun ih ka lo zuah vekin Bawipa in ka nunnak cu sunloih in i zuah ve hramsehla, zonzaih harsatnak in i luatter hram seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “Pathian in lo thluasuah hram seh, ka fapa. Thil nasa zetzet na tuah pei ih na tuahmi kipah na hlawh a tling ding,” tiah a ti. Cuih hnuah David cu a feh ih Saul cu inn ah a tlung. S
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David cu a thinlungte in, “Nikhat khatah Saul in i that leh ko ding. Ka hrangih a ṭha bik cu Filistin ramih tlanhlo a si. Cutiih ka tlanhlo ahcun Israel ram sungah Saul in i hawl nawn lo dingih ka him ding,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Curuangah David le a ralkap zaruk cu zamrangte in Gath siangpahrang Akhish, Ma-ok ih fapa, hnenah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David le a ralkap pawl cu an innsang pawl thawn Gath ram ahcun an um. David cu nupi pahnih a nei: Jezreel khuami Ahinoam le Karmel khuami Nabal ih thihsan mi Abigail an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David cu Gath ramah a tlan zo ti Saul in a theih tikah David hawl ding cu a tum nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun David in Akhish hnenah, “Na rualpi ngaingai ih i ruat a si ahcun ka umnak hrangah khua pakhat i pe ve aw. Siangpahrang nangmah thawn na khawpi sungih umtlang hi a mawi lem lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Akhish in David cu Ziklag an timi khua a pek. A cuihsan thokin Ziklag khua cu Judah siangpahrang ih ta a si ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Filistin ramah David cu kum khat le thlali a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David le a milai pawl in a cuih ram sungih kum reipi a rak um zo mi Geshur mi, Girzi mi le Amalek mi pawl cu an do ṭheu. Izipt ram thleng tiangin an siim hai ṭheu ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />nunau siseh, mipa siseh, an that thluh ṭheu. Cun an tuu, an caw, an laak le an kalauk pawl an lak ih an hnipuan tiangin an long thluh. Cule Akhish hnenih a thlen sal tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Akhish cun, “Tuihṭum khui ram so na siim?” tiih a suh tikah David cun, Judah ram thlanglam kapah ka feh, a ti tawk; a si lole Jerahmeel miphun ramah ka feh, a ti tawk; a si lole Ken mi pawl umnak ramah ka feh, a ti tawk a si ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in nunau siseh, mipa siseh a that thluh ṭheu ih Gath ramah feh tahratin David le a ralkap pawl ih thil tuahmi va simtu dingah milai an um ṭheu lo. Filistin ramih a um sung hmuahhmuah David in cubangtuk in a tuah ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Akhish in, David cu a zumzet ruangah a thinlungte in, “Amah ih milai Israel mi pawl in an huat tuk ruangah a nunsung hmuahhmuah ka hnaṭuan in a um ko ding,” tiah a ruat.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tikcu a hung rei deuh tikah Filistin pawl cu Israel do dingah an ralkap pawl an khawm ciamco. Cutikah David cu Akhish in, “Nang le na ralkap pawl cu kan hnenah ṭangin Israel nan do ding a si lo maw?” tiah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in, “Si e; na salpa ka si ih ka thil titheizia na zoh pei cu,” a ti. Cutikah Akhish in, “A ṭha! Kumkhua keimah kiltu ah ka lo tuah ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel cu a thi zo ih Israel mi hmuahhmuah in an ṭah ih amah ih khua Ramah ah an phum. Israel ramsung ihsin kutṭial zohthiam le pol hmuahhmuah cu Saul siangpahrang in a dawitlan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistin ralkap pawl cu an khawm-aw ih Shunem khua kiangah an riak. Israel ralkap pawl cu Saul in a kokhawm ih Gilboa tlang parah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul in Filistin ralkap pawl a hmuh tikah a thin a phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in Bawipa thu a ron. Asinain Bawipa in mang in siseh, Urim le Thummim zohnakin siseh, profet in siseh thu a let hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in a kuthnuai bawi pawl cu, “Tin ka len theinak dingah nunau pakhat, pol a si mi ka hrangah hawl uh,” tiah thu a pek. “Endor khua ah pakhat a um,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah Saul cu midang ah a tuah-aw ih hnipuan phundang a hruk ih, a milai pahnih thawn a cuih nunau nu hnenah cun khawthim hnuah an feh. Cule Saul in, “Na khuavang i kawh sak awla hmailam ah ziang a cang ding ti i suh sak aw. A hmin ka lo sim mi mithi pa i kawh sak aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain nunau nu cun, “Israel ramsung ihsin Saul siangpahrang in kutṭial zohthiam pawl le pol hmuahhmuah a dawi thluh a si ti cu na thei ko. Ziangah so pol ka sinak hi thei hai sehla that hai seh tiih a bum i tum?” tiah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in thukamnak a tuah ih, “A nungmi Bawipa ih hmin sal in ka lo kam: hih mithi kawh ruangah cun an lo that hrimhrim lo ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule nunau nu cun, “Zoso ka lo kawh sak ding?” tiah a sut. “Samuel ko aw,” tiah Saul in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nunau nu cun Samuel a hmuh tikah a raak ciamco. “Ziangah so i bum? Saul siangpahrang na sisi!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Saul in, “ṭihhlahaw. Ziang so na hmuh?” tiah a sut. Nunau nu in, “Leilung sung ihsin mithi thlarau pakhat a hung suah ka hmu,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ziangvek so a si?” tiah Saul in a sut. “A hung suakmi cu patar pa a si. Kor fualpi a hruk,” tiah nunau nu cun a ti. Cutikah Samuel a si ti kha Saul cun a thei ih upatnak in leilung ah a kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Samuel in Saul cu, “Ziangah so i hnaihnok? Ziangah so i kir ter sal?” tiah a sut. Saul in, “Ka van a sang ngaingai a si. Filistin mi pawl in in do ih Pathian in i dungtun zo. Ka thusuhmi pawl i let lo. Profet in siseh, mang in siseh, i let hrimhrim nawn lo. Curuangah ziangso ka tuah ding, ti i simtu dingah ka lo ko a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Samuel in, “Ziangah so Pathian ih a lo dungtun hnuah le na ral ih a can hnuah kei cu i kawh duh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnen ihsin a lo simmi kha na parah a kim ter zo - na ram uknak cu na hnen ihsin a lakih na ai-ah David a pek zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa ih thupekmi na thlun lo ih Amalek mi pawl le an neih mi hmuahhmuah a zatein na siatsuah thluh lo. Curuangah Bawipa in hiti ih a lo tuahnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangmah le Israel mi pawl cu Bawipa in Filistin mi pawl kut sungah a lo pek ding. Thaisun ah nangmah le na fapa pawl cu ka hnenah nan rung thlang ding. Cule Israel ralkap pawl cu Bawipa in Filistin mi pawl ih kut sungah a pek thluh ding a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul cu hmakhatte-ah a tlu ih leilung ah a ril. Samuel ih simmi thu cu a ṭih tuk lawmmam. Sunvu le zanvar zianghman a ei fawn lo ruangah Saul cu a ṭamsawl ih tha a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pol nu in Saul ih tluknak ahcun a va pan ih a thin a phangzet ti a hmuh ruangah a hnenah, “Bawipa, ka nunnak hman ruat loin i fial mi cu ka tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah atu ka lo fial mi hi tuah ve hram aw. Na hrangah rawl malte ka lo tuahsak pei. Ei awla na lamzin fehnak ah tha na nei deuh ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul in a ei duh lo; “Zianghman ka ei lo ding,” a ti. Asinain a kuthnuai bawi pawl khal in ei dingah an hneek ve ih a neta bik ahcun an thu cu a thlun. Leilung ihsin a tho ih ihkhun parah a to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah nunau nu cun thauseh ti ih a rak cawm rero mi caw note pakhat zamrangin a that. Sangphut a lak ih a hmal thluh hnuah thilnu tello sangah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul le a kuthnuai bawi pawl ih hmai ahcun rawl cu a hun ih an ei. Cule a cuih zan ahcun an kir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl in an ralkap pawl cu Afek ah an khawm ih, Israel mi pawl cu Jezreel Phairawn ih cerhti kiangah an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin lal panga pawl cu an ralkap zakhat rual le thawngkhat rual pawl thawn hmailam ah an feh zutzo ih David le a ralkap pawl cun dunglam ihsin Akhish thawn an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistin ralbawi pawl in, “Hi Hebru mi pawl hi hitawk ah ziangso an tuah ve?” tiah an sut. Cutikah Akhish in, “Hi pa hi Israel siangpahrang Saul ih ralbawi David a si. Ka hnenih a umnak a rei nawn thlang. Ka hnenih a rathlen thokin tuihsun tiangah thilsual a tuahmi zianghman ka hmu lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Filistin ralbawi pawl cu an thin a heng ih Akhish hnenah, “Hi pa cu umnak khua na pekmi ah kirter sal aw. Kan hnenah cun fehter hrimhrim hlah. Ziangahtile ral kan do tikah kanmah siatsuahtu kanmah ih ral riangri-ah a cang pang ding. A bawipa thawn an rem-awk salnak dingah cun kan ralkap pawl ih luhlohnak cu amah ih hrangah lamzin ṭha bik a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thungai ti ahcun, nunau pawl ih an laam phah ah: ‘Saul cun a thawng a sawm in a that; David cun a thawng a za in a that,’ ti ih hla an phuahmi kha amah David hi a sisi!” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akhish in David cu a ko ih a hnenah, “A nungmi Bawipa ih hmin salin ka lo sim: ka hrangah rintlak ngaingai na si ih ka hnenah feh tahratin ral do ve cila ka duh zet. Ka hnenih na rathlen thok ihsin na mawhnak ka hmu hrih lo. Asinain Filistin lal dang pawl in an lo duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah daitein va kir aw; an thinhengnak ding zianghman tuah hlah aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah David in, “Ziang so ka sual? Na hnen ka thlen ih na hna ka ṭuan thok ihsin, bawipa, ka mawhnak zianghman na hmu lo. Ziangah so ka bawipa le ka siangpahrang nangmah thawn ka feh lo ding? Ziangah so na ral pawl do loin ka kir men ding?” tiah a el ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Akhish in, “David, nang cu Pathian ih vancungmi tlukih a felmi na si ti ka thei ko. Sikhalsehla Filistin ralbawi pawl in ral donak ah kan hnenah feh hlah seh, tiah an lo ti zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Curuangah Saul siangpahrang taan tahratin ka hnenih a rami hmuahhmuah nan zatein thaizing khua a van vete in nan kir ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah David le a milai pawl cu Filistin ramih kir dingah a thaizing zingpit in an pok. Filistin ralkap pawl cu Jezreel lamah an feh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni thumnak ah David le a ralkap pawl cu Ziklag khua an thleng. Amalek mi pawl in Judah ram thlanglam kap kha an rak ram ih Ziklag khua khal an rak lak ih meisa in an ur thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nunau hmuahhmuah an kai ih, zohman an that lonain an zatein an hruai thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David le a ralkap pawl an va thlen tikah an khua cu a rak kang thluh zo ih an nupi le an fanu le an fapa pawl cu an rak hruaihlo thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David le a milai pawl cu ringzet in an ṭap ih an tha cem in an ṭah thei nawn lo tiangin an ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David ih nupi pahnih Ahinoam le Abigail khal an hruaimi pawl lakah an rak tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David cu vansanglam in a um. Ziangahtile a milai pawl ih faate pawl cu salih hruai thluh an si ruangah an thin a na ngaingai ih David cu lungto ih den an tum. Asinain a Bawipa Pathian hnen ihsin thazaang cahnak a ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule David in Ahimelek ih fapa puithiam Abiathar hnenah, “Puithiam ṭaangthlaih kor cu i pe aw,” tiah a ti ih, Abiathar cun a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David cun Bawipa ih hnenah, “In ramtu pawl cu ka dawi pei maw? Ka dawi asile ka kai hai pei maw?” tiah a sut. Cutikah Bawipa in, “Dawi aw; na kai hai dingih an hruai mi pawl khal na runsuak ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah David cu a ralkap zaruk thawn an pok ih Besor Tiva an thleng; cutawkah mi hrekkhat an taangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A milai sung ihsin zahnih cu an baang tukih tiva an tan thei lo ruangah an taangta. David le a milai zali pawl in an dawi vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule a milai pawl in hramlakah Izipt nauhakpa pakhat an sar ih David hnenah an fehpi. Ti le rawl an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Theirah car malte le an carmi sabit rah bawr hnih tla an pe. A ei hnuah a ṭamsawl cu a ṭha. Nithum sung zianghman in lo le ei loin a rak um a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule David in, “Na bawipa zoso a si? Khuitawk in so na rat?” tiah a sut. Cutikah anih in, “Izipt mi ka si ih Amalek mi pa pakhat ih sal ka si. Ka nat ruangah hitawk ah hin ka bawipa in i taanta a si. I taannak ni thum a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kereth ram thlanglam kap hrawng, Judah ram thlanglam kap le Kaleb miphun pawl ih ram tla kan ram ih Ziklag khua tla kan ur thluh,” tiah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in, “A cuih miramtu pawl hnenah cun i hruai pei maw?” tiah a sut. Nauhak pa in, “Ka lo that hrimhrim lo ding ih na bawipa ih hnen khalah ka lo pek lo ding, tiah Pathian hmin sal in thu i kam a si ahcun ka lo hruai ko ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah cupa in David cu a hruai. Amalek mi pawl in Filistin ram le Judah ram ihsin ral thilri an lakmi pawl cu a tam ngaingai ruangah, an aih ih zu an in, sa an ei, puai an tuah ih hmun kipah an darh-aw ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Culai ah David in a nam hai ih zingpit ihsin zanlam khawthim tiang a do. Tlangval zali cu kalauk an to ih an tlanhlo. Cupawl siarlo, pakhat hman luat loin an that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amalek mi pawl ih an kaihmi le an lakmi hmuahhmuah, amah ih nupi pahnih thawn a runsuak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zianghman a hlosuakmi a um lo. An fanu le an fapa pawl siseh, an thilri pawl siseh, David in a lak kirsal thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuu le caw pawl khal a rual a rual in a ngah sal thluh. A milai pawl in ṭilva pawl cu hmaiah an khor vivo ih, “David ih ta an si,” tiah an au phah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun David a thlun thei nawn lo ih Besor Tiva ih a taangta mi a milai zahnih hnenah David cu a va thleng sal. A cuih a milai pawl cun David le a ralkap pawl cu an rak hmuak ih David tla in an hnen a thlen tikah lungawi zetin cibai a buk hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain David hnenih a feh vemi halhsik neimi le hawizawng lo mihlotlau hrekkhat pawl in, “Annih cu kan hnenih an feh ve lo ruangah thilri kan lakmi pawl hi kan zem hai lo ding. An nupi le an faale pawl hi la hai sehla feh ko hai seh,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain David in, “Unaule uh, Bawipa ih in pekmi thilri parah cutiin nan tuah thei lo ding. Amah in in kilkhawi ih mi ramtu pawl ih parah nehnak in pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nan simmi cu zohman an lung a kim thei lo ding. Zozo khal bangrep tein co ciar ding a si. Thilri kan taanmi hnenih a rung taang mi khal in raldonak ih a fehmi co zat thotho in a co ve pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cumi cu David in daanah a tuah ih Israel ramsungah atu tiangin an thlun dahta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David cu Ziklag ih a thlen sal tikah ral hnen ihsin an lakmi thilri pawl hrekkhat cu Judah mi hotu, a rualpi pawl hnenah a kuat ih, “ Bawipa ih ral pawl hnen ihsin kan lakmi thilri malte laksawng ah kan lo ṭhen,” tiah a cah vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bethel ih a ummi, Judah ram thlanglam Ramah ih a ummi, Jattir peng khua pawl ih a ummi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer khua, Sifmoth khua, Eshtemoa khua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rakal khua, Jerahmeel miphun ih khua pawl, Ken miphun ih khua pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hormah peng, Borashan peng le Athak peng le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron ram sungih a ummi khawsungmi hmuahhmuah hnenah a kuat. Amah David le a milai pawl an rak thlennak khua hmuahhmuah ah a kuat thluh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin mi le Israel mi pawl cu Gilbon tlang ah nasa zetin an do aw. Cutawkah Israel mi tampi an thi ih, a taangmi cu Saul le a fapa pawl thawn an tlan thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin mi pawl in Saul le a fapa pawl cu an man ih a fapa Jonathan, Abinadab le Malkhishua pawl cu an that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ral a luar vivo ih Saul cu conkiang in an ngah ih besia zetin an hriam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah Saul in a hriamnam kengtu tlangvalpa ih hnenah, “Hi serhtan lo Filistin pawl in dekcoknak menah in hman ih in thah ding hnak cun na ralnam zuuk awla nangmah in i that sawn aw,” tiah a ti. Asinain tlangvalpa cun a ngam lo. Curuangah Saul cun a ralnam zik zum a tluk cih ih a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul a thih kha tlangvalpa in a hmuh tikah anih khal a ralnam a zuuk ih a tlukcih ih Saul hnenah a thi ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuticun Saul le a fapa pathum le tlangvalpa cu hmun khatah an thi. Cuih ni ah Saul ih milai pawl cu an thi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezreel horkuam ralih a ummi le Jordan Tiva ihsin nisuahnak lamih a ummi Israel mi pawl in Israel ralkap pawl an tlan thluh ih Saul le a fapa pawl khal an thi thluh ti an theih tikah an khua pawl cu an taan ih an tlanhlo thluh. Cuih hnuah Filistin mi pawl an ra ih cuih khua pawl cu an ra luah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An do-awk ni ih thaisun ah a thimi pawl ih ralthuam la dingah Filistin pawl an feh ih Gilboa tlang an thlen tikah Saul le a fapa pathum ih ruak an ril teptep kha an hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul ih lu cu an tan hnuah a ralthuam pawl an lak. Cule a cuih thuthang cu an milem pawl le misenpi hnenih sim dingah Filistin ram khuazakip ah mi an thlah ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Saul ih ralthuam cu Astartes khawzingnu an biaknak inn ah an ret ih a ruak cu Bethshan khawpi kulhnak hauhruang parah an taar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistin pawl in Saul ih ruak parih an tuah daan cu Gilead ramih Jabesh khuami pawl in an theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />anmah lakih ralṭha bik pawl an pok ih zanvarte Bethshan khua ahcun an feh. Hauhruang parih sin Saul le a fapa pawl ruak cu an lak ih Jabesh khua ah an zawn ih cutawkah meisa in an ur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule an ruh pawl cu an lak ih an khawsung tuumkung hnuai ah an phum ih ni sarih sung rawl an ul.
  </para>
</usx>
